      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3643015350",
      "Source": "A hefty chunk of stone.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一块大石头。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3902028550",
      "Source": "A helmet made from a unique combination of materials that protect the wearer from environmental contaminants.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"由多种特殊材料制作的头盔, 能保护穿着者免受环境污染。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4114372802",
      "Source": "A herd Megaloceroses have left their usual grounds and are wandering the biome. Hunt them down!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一群大角鹿离开了它们通常的栖息地四处游荡。狩猎它们吧!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1778403504",
      "Source": "A high level Brute Allosaurus Pack is on the prowl, take it down!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一群高等等级的凶恶异特龙正在四处游荡, 解决它们!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1891229947",
      "Source": "A high quality pollen spore. These are often dropped by specific pollen plants within the Bog biome.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种高品质的花粉孢子。它们通常来自于沼泽生态圈中的特定开花植物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2526504485",
      "Source": "A high-caliber modern bullet, primarily used with fabricated sniper rifles.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种大口径的现代子弹, 主要供制式狙击步枪使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::354060062",
      "Source": "A high-tech bow made of durable alloy, can launch arrows at high velocity.  Requires arrows to fire.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"由耐用的合金制成的高科技弓, 可以以很高的速度发射弓箭。需要箭支搭配使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1599238315",
      "Source": "A highly concentrated and hardened gas deposit. This could be refined back into it's gaseous form.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种被高度浓缩硬化过的气体沉淀物。处理后可以恢复成气态形式。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1162512989",
      "Source": "A horde grows on the horizon, larger than we have ever seen, and led by a demon who stands so tall that mountains bask in his shadow. When we realized it was headed our way, we picked up our camp and made for the wastes. Yet as we moved, the horde followed. This is not mere misfortune, it is a hunt, and we are the prey.\n\nHelena claimed the gemstone may be able to help us, but I still forbade her from touching it. When we fight back-to-back, I can watch over her, but I can't protect her from something I don't understand.\n\nNo, should battle be joined, we shall meet them head on. No matter the size of our foes, I will fight with all that I am, and for the sake of everyone here, I will win. I must.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"天际忽现兽群 数量之多见所未见 领头妖魔驻地而起 遮阴盖影 来袭之时 吾方慌忙撤营 然兽群步步紧逼也 不幸之至 此狩猎也 余为猎物\n\n海莲娜所言 此宝石或可成余之助力 然吾不允其触及宝石 背抵背而战之时 余可保海莲娜 然余无力保其免受未知之物之害\n\n此言差矣 欲战则迎头而战 敌数不在话下 吾当尽吾所能 所为众人而战 吾将胜 吾必胜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3611017299",
      "Source": "A large adobe gate that can be used with a Gateway to keep most dinosaurs in or out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个黏土恐龙门, 可以安放在黏土恐龙门框上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
