    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4091826192",
      "Source": "A lump of unrefined metal ore, mined from rocks usually found high on mountains, or in caves. Can be refined in a Forge.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一块未精炼的金属矿石, 大多从山上或洞穴里的岩石开采出来。可在熔炼炉中加工。","JA":""},
