      "Source": "A metal-framed, glass ceiling that provides insulation, and doubles as a floor for higher levels.  Excellent for growing crops indoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种金属框制的玻璃天花板, 可提供隔热效果, 并可作为更高楼层的地板。非常适合用于建造种植室内作物的房间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2233705500",
      "Source": "A metal-framed, glass door that provides entrance to structures. Can be locked for security.  Excellent for growing crops indoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种金属框制的玻璃门, 为建筑物提供入口。为了安全起见, 可以将其锁定。非常适合用于建造种植室内作物的房间。","JA":""},
