    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4238495182",
      "Source": "A mighty hammer fit for a god, thrumming with the fury of thunder itself!\n\nApply this item to a TEK sword to change it into Mjolnir!\nRequires the TEK sword engram to use.\nRequires Level 190 to use.\nRequires defeating Fenrisúlfr (Alpha) to use.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个只有神才能与之相配的神锤, 它带来的震撼本是雷霆的愤怒! 将此物品应用于泰克剑上, 可将其变为雷神之锤!\n需要解锁泰克剑的印痕以后才能使用。\n需要升到190级以后才能使用。\n需要击败芬里尔巨狼 (困难) 以后才能使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2841035494",
      "Source": "A multiplier on how fast Imprinting Qualitiy\ndecreases after the grace period if the\nplayers has not yet cuddled with the Baby.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"影响留痕任务超时之后\n留痕品质下降的速度。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::254510415",
