      "NamespaceHash": "Content::594624538",
      "Source": "A pod containing 16 swarm-fire rockets. Used as ammunition for the Mek Rocket Launcher Module.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个装有16发弹幕火箭的弹仓。作为机甲火箭发射器模块的弹药。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4211395204",
      "Source": "A portable cage in which to imprison victims.",
