      "Trans": {"SC":"镰刀龙的鞍。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3717947351",
      "Source": "A saddle for your horse. Useful for crafting chemical supplies on the go!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个马鞍。方便随身制作药剂!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3608531483",
      "Source": "A sappy vegetable cake which Herbivores find delicious, which will be automatically eaten when needed for healing. Alas, humans and carnivores tend to find its taste repugnant. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种深受食草动物喜爱的多汁蔬菜蛋糕。食草动物在受伤时会主动进食它们。不过人类和食肉动物无法接受它的口味。 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2197836836",
      "Source": "A set of tribal wardrums, to let everyone around hear the power of your tribe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一套部落战鼓, 让周围的人都听到你部落的力量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2709776661",
      "Source": "A sharp flint hatchet for harvesting wood from trees, stone from rocks, and skin from bodies.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一把锋利的碎石斧子, 适合从树木采集木头, 岩石采集石头, 尸体采集兽皮。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
