      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2841623434",
      "Source": "A thin walkway for bridging areas together.  Made from sturdy wood.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的栈桥, 用来连接不同的区域。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1601675808",
      "Source": "A tooth from a rare slain Golden Striped Megalodon. This trophy proves your worth as a hunter.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一颗来自于稀有的金色条纹巨齿鲨的牙齿。这个战利品证明了你作为一名猎人的价值。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2369453014",
      "Source": "A torch on a metal connector that lights and warms the immediate area. Must be placed on a wall.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个带有金属连接的可以照亮照暖当前区域的火炬。必须放在墙上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1490536050",
      "Source": "A torch on a tall piece of wood that lights and warms the immediate area.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个带有长管的火炬。可以提供照明和热量。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4228926657",
      "Source": "A very rare resource, found underground.  Can be broken down and used to make modern tech.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种发现于地下的稀有资源。可以被分解和用于现代科技。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4046823727",
      "Source": "A volatile substance that can be used to raise Rock Drakes!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种不稳定的物质, 可用于喂养岩龙!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1583862236",
      "Source": "A wall that is as tall as four normal walls.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一堵高度为正常四倍的墙壁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1780049765",
      "Source": "A wall with a hole for a door.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"带门框的墙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1890610402",
      "Source": "A wall with a hole for a window.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"带窗框的墙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3705001413",
      "Source": "A wavy blueish-green mushroom with a glowing edge. Looks refreshing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"边缘微微闪着光的青色蘑菇。看上去很提神。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2084549226",
      "Source": "A woman named Helena arrived at my camp yesterday, though not to hire me. She said that she was a scholar studying the creatures on this island, and that she wanted to observe my beasts. I turned her away at first, not trusting her intentions. How could I? What mad fool would bother with scholarly pursuits in a place like this? Yet she persisted, and in time I was convinced of her honesty.\n\nI don't know if I made the right decision. Helena is constantly asking strange questions. Why does she need to know so much about my beasts' feces and mating behavior? What a bizarre person.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有女名海莲娜, 昨至吾营, 非为顾吾。其言本为学者, 学岛上之兽, 望观吾之兽群。吾始拒之所求。因不明其所为, 何能将兽交与此女? 且与此岛探究学术, 是疯人邪? 然其志坚不弃, 少时以诚相服。\n\n吾不知此之对错。海莲娜怪问不断, 如吾兽之排便与交配之习。不知其为何有此问, 怪人也。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3429112214",
      "Source": "A wood, sloped triangle roof.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个木制三角倾斜屋顶。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3353545098",
      "Source": "A wooden shield on a layer of leather. Absorbs damage from the front when activated.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"带有一层皮的木制盾牌。使用后可吸收正面伤害。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2718570519",
      "Source": "A wooden spiral staircase, useful in constructing multi-level buildings.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个木制螺旋楼梯, 可用于楼层之间的来回移动。 ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::140781927",
      "Source": "A wooden wall that provides entrance to a structure.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的门框, 用来安放各式各样的门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1425025808",
      "Source": "A wooden wall with a hole for a window.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的窗框, 用来安放窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2333633153",
      "Source": "ABERRATION",
      "Trans": {"SC":"畸变","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3221413509",
      "Source": "ABERRATION:\nWaking up on Aberration, a derelict, malfunctioning ARK with an elaborate underground biome system, survivors face exotic new challenges unlike anything before: extreme radioactive sunlight and environmental hazards, ziplines, wingsuits, climbing gear, cave dwellings, charge-batteries, and far more, along with a stable of extraordinary new creatures await within the mysterious depths. But beware the 'Nameless': unrelenting, Element-infused humanoids which have evolved into vicious light-hating monstrosities! On Aberration, survivors will uncover the ultimate secrets of the ARKs, and discover what the future holds in store for those strong and clever enough to survive!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"畸变: \n这是一个因故障而被废弃的方舟。生存者将在畸变的地下世界中醒来, 在这里面临异乎寻常的挑战: 极端日照辐射和环境灾害、滑索、滑翔翼、登山镐、穴居生物、蓄电池等等。神秘的深渊里还有各种非凡的新物种等待人们的发现。但是要特别小心“无名怪”, 这是一种被元素腐蚀且畏光的类人生物! 在畸变的世界中, 只有最坚强聪明的生存者才能发现方舟的终极秘密!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
