    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::578994238",
      "Source": "ARKs are quite large and can take many hours to explore. The key to navigating the enormous environments is to recognize landmarks such as Obelisks, Caves, or Mountains as well as which Biomes they are found in, and correlate this with your mini-map. The coast regions are the safest area to navigate. As you move deeper in-land and further up into high altitude areas, the difficulty of the map will increase. Fully explore the ARK to uncover its secrets and discover the hidden Artifacts found in the caves and use the Obelisks to challenge and conquer the guardians, so that you can unravel the mysteries of the ARK.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"方舟的世界非常广袤, 需要花费大量时间来探索。掌握定位技巧的关键是要能辨识出各种地标。将方尖碑、 洞穴、山峰以及它们周遭的生态地貌与您的小地图联系起来。沿海地带一般是最安全的地区。随着您向内陆挺进, 并且进入高海拔地区, 地图的难度将会增加。充分探索方舟世界, 发现其中的秘密, 找到隐藏在洞穴中的上古神器并且用它们来召唤守护者。在打败了这些无比强大的敌人后, 您便可以揭开方舟世界的神秘面纱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
