    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1220368953",
      "Source": "Accessing:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"查看:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1757860402",
      "Source": "According to the maps, we are nearing the tomb's location. I have made short work of the monsters and disfigured beasts that have stood in our way, and the path ahead seems clear. However something looms behind us, growing ever closer.\n\nIt's another horde, and while it lacks the mountainous demon that attacked us before, there are other, lesser devils in its place. Though smaller than their master, they are still far larger than any normal beast, and their might will be considerable.\n\nFortunately, my pack is outpacing them. We should arrive at the tomb well ahead of the horde, and if I can heal Helena quickly, we may be able to avoid it all together.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"据图所悉 陵墓方位将至 野兽怪物 凡挡吾路者 皆为我所杀 前路畅顺 然感幽影在下 日渐趋近\n\n又有一兽群 虽无前时袭吾之山巨妖魔 宵小恶魔为位也 虽不比山巨妖魔之大 甚于寻常野兽也 其力不容小视\n\n甚幸 吾之驯兽群迅速也 甚于妖魔群 先其一步抵陵墓 倘海莲娜之愈不费时 妖魔群无不可避也","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1497577659",
      "Source": "Achatina secretion chemically similar to cementing paste.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"玛瑙螺分泌物的化学性质和水泥相似。","JA":""},
