    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1154576369",
      "Source": "Back",
      "Trans": {"SC":"返回","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1089953037",
      "Source": "Back in Luxor, I always tried to stay out of politics. I never aspired to be Divine Adoratrice as some priestesses did. I found that such selfish ambitions often led to suffering – both for oneself and for others.\n\nSo when Girisha referred to me as our leader today, I found myself surprised. I had never asked for such a position, and the others had never bestowed it on me in any official manner. It just happened naturally.\n\nI am not sure what to make of it, but if this is Hathor's will, then I will try to guide these people as best as I can.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当我还在卢克索(埃及中东部的一个城市)的时, 我总是试图远离政治。我从没像一些祭祀一样渴望成为大祭司。我发现, 这种自私的野心通常都会给自己和他人带领痛苦。 \n\n所以当吉丽莎提名我担任我们的领导人的时候, 我很吃惊。我从没有奢望过这个职位, 而且其他人也从没有让我正式担。这自然而然的发生了。\n\n我不知道我该如何应对, 但如果这是哈索尔的意志, 那么我会尽我所能去引导这些人。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
