    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3589563099",
      "Source": "Blizzard",
      "Trans": {"SC":"暴风雪","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::173089825",
      "Source": "Blocking",
      "Trans": {"SC":"阻挡","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3615481911",
      "Source": "Blondie didn't approve of my decision. I've never been very good at persuasion, so I let my pistol make my case. The others saw it my way after that.\n\nConvincing Raia was a lot less trouble. She knew the settlement's guards weren't exactly the cream of the crop, and that if I'd wanted trouble, I'd have already made it. When Raia talks, people listen. I can tell that much from watching her, but in a lawless place like this, words aren't enough. It didn't take long for us to come to terms.\n\nWell, I suppose I'd better inspect the troops. Maybe a few of them can shoot.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金发女没有同意我的决定。我一直都不擅长口头说服别人, 所以我一般靠枪杆子说话。自打那以后, 其他人便认同我这种方式了。\n\n说服莱雅没花那么大功夫。她知道村落里的卫兵不是最优秀的, 如果我想要惹麻烦, 我早就做了。但是大家都听莱雅的。要我说在这样一个法外之地, 光靠嘴巴是不够的。过了没多久我们就达成了协议。\n\n好吧, 我想我最好检阅一下军队。或许他们之中有些人能用枪。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1801293551",
      "Source": "Blood Curse Recovery!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吸血恢复生命!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2196091525",
      "Source": "Blood Cursed!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"吸血诅咒","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::289239712",
      "Source": "Blood Hollows",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鲜血山谷","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
