      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2770087046",
      "Source": "Brilliant! Absolutely brilliant! The test went more splendidly than I could have imagined!\nI used one of the small, glowing creatures that the villagers keep as pets for my first subject. It was a timid, fragile thing, that is until I injected a full dose of pure, molten Edmundium into its veins. Then, as I predicted, it ascended! Within minutes it grew in size and power, until at last it was a mighty, fearsome beast!\nAlas, that meddler Diana \"put it down\" before I could study it more closely. Bah! That was no mercy. That was as close as that worthless creature would ever get to tasting godhood, and she ripped it away! She is the murderer, not I! One day, she shall be punished for it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"棒极了! 超级棒! 这次测试比我预期的还要好!\n\n我把被村民当做宠物饲养的小东西作为了第一个实验对象。它既胆小又脆弱, 直到我向它的血管中注射了满满一剂纯净的液化艾德蒙金属。就如我预料的那般,它飞升了! 片刻之内它的体型和力量急剧增长, 迅速变成了一个恐怖的野兽!\n\n很可惜, 在我刚要凑近研究之前, 那爱管闲事的戴安娜把它撂倒了。哎! 太残忍了。本来那个毫无价值的生物差一点就能神化了, 而她却毁了它! 她才是凶手, 不是我! 总有一天她会受到惩罚的。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
