      "Trans": {"SC":"控制台距离: 0米","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1517460638",
      "Source": "Construct",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建造","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2228127831",
      "Source": "Construction has been going well. None of us are architects but we have been adjusting to our roles.\n\nGirisha's broad shoulders and booming laugh conceal a keen mind, and we started making better progress once I convinced him to stop hauling rocks and start drawing up plans. That let Amir focus on starting a garden, where he is more at home.\n\nI have focused on trying to keeping us organized and maintaining our spirits, myself. I wish I could do more. Sadly, while a priestess has many gifts, manual labor is not one of them. I often find myself winded before midday. I pray that the others do not find me burdensome.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"施工进展顺利。我们之中没有人是建筑师, 但我们一直在调整自己的角色。\n\n隐藏在吉里什宽阔肩膀和爽朗笑声背后的是一个思维敏锐的头脑。当我说服他不要再摆弄石块而是要开始制定计划后, 我们的进展快了很多。那让阿米尔可以全身心建造一个花园, 这可以让他有家的感觉。\n\n我则一心一意试图让我们保持效率和士气。我希望我能做得更好。可惜, 虽然女祭司有很多天赋, 但并不擅长体力劳动。我经常在中午前就已经感到力不从心。我祈祷其他人不会觉得我是个累赘。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2756250669",
      "Source": "Construction on Camp Omega is going well. Things usually do when I have a project to focus on. I'd prefer something more challenging than living quarters, stables and basic defenses, but this'll keep me busy for now.\n\nI'm the de-facto leader of this outfit these days, I realize that. No one else still among the living is qualified, so fine, I'll do the job. I just can't stand being bothered with every little disagreement or emotional breakdown. I've got real work to do, solving real problems.\n\nThat's why I made the Federation set me up in that mountain villa as part of my contract. My little hideaway, with just me and whatever puzzle they needed me to solve. It was perfect. Had a great sound system too. Assuming my memories are real, anyway.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欧米茄营地的建设工作进展良好。当我专注时, 事情通常都会很顺利。我希望能有一些比建设生活区、恐龙区和基础防御工事更有挑战性的事情, 但这足够让我忙上一小会了。\n\n这些天以来, 我意识到自己是这里的实际领导者。其他活人没有一个合格的, 好吧, 就我来当吧。我只是没法忍受被不满和情绪崩溃所打扰。我还有真正的工作要做, 它可以解决本质问题。\n\n这就是为什么我以前让联邦需要按照合同把我安排在山区的别墅里。我的小窝, 只有我自己和需要我解决的问题。它太完美了。还有一套很棒的音响。前提是我的记忆是真实的话。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::151783035",
      "Source": "Consumable",
      "Trans": {"SC":"消耗品","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
