      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::460983942",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Air Guitar\" emote. For strumming those sick riffs.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“弹空气吉他”的表情。 \n想即兴演奏时就使用吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4038150161",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Archer Flex\" emote.\n\nThat Paleo diet is paying off!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“射箭”表情。\n原始人饮食法起效了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3691584883",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Backflip\" emote.\n\nShow everyone that you're flipping awesome.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“后空翻”表情。\n让每个人都知道你跳得棒极了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1701433346",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Belly Rub\" emote.\nI'm full... but I wouldn't say no to seconds.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“揉肚子”表情。\n我饱了...但我不会拒绝再来一口。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2059542970",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Bicep Smooch\" emote.\n\nShow everyone that you're \"heavily armed.\"",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“二头之吻”表情。\n给大家看看你的武装有多“大”。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1740818102",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Bunny Hop Dance\" emote. You'll be a real hip hop dancer!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“兔跳舞”表情。\n你会成为一名真正的嘻哈舞者!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1641414438",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Caroling\" emote.\nSing for the season!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“颂歌”表情。\n这是吟唱的时节!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::520701769",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Chest Beat\" emote.\n\nShow everyone else who is the ultimate Alpha. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“捶胸”表情。\n向所有人展示谁是顶级精英!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3578374585",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Dance\" emote.\n\nGive a thrill to everyone who sees your dance moves. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“跳舞”表情。\n向大家展示一下你优美的舞步吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3362596555",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Flirty\" Emote!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“调情”表情。\n你害羞了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3833320135",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Food Coma\" emote.\n\nWhen you're more stuffed than a turkey, a nap is in your future.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“嗝又瘫”表情。\n当你被塞得比火鸡还满的时候, 最好还是打个盹吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2300026562",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Happy Clap\" emote.\nOoooo, I get a present?!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“欢乐鼓掌”表情。\n噢噢噢, 我有礼物吗? !","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3634807005",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Heart\" Emote!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“爱心”表情!\n感受到我的爱意了吗?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3523945891",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Hula Dance\" emote.\n\nShow everyone that you 'auana dance",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“呼啦舞”表情。\n向所有人展示你的舞姿。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2246777836",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Hungry\" emote.\nI want a feast, and I want it now!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“饥饿”表情。\n我要吃大餐, 我现在就要吃!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1127717602",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Knock\" emote. Knock knock! Boo's there?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“敲门”表情。\n敲敲门, 谁在对面啊? ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2412027150",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Mosh Pit\" emote. Get hyped, jump in, and go for it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“狂舞”表情。\n来! 嗨起来!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::59217607",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Nutcracker Dance\" emote.\nDance the dance of the season!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“胡桃夹子舞”表情。\n跳舞的节日!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1183368111",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Panic\" emote.\n\nShow everyone just how terrified you are.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“惊恐”表情。\n让大家看看你有多害怕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::104317595",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Santa Laugh\" emote. You'll laugh when you do this, in spite of yourself!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“圣诞老人笑声”表情。\n别管其他事, 当你这样做时你总会笑出来的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3281297112",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Scare\" emote. Gotcha!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“惊吓”表情。\n吓到你了吧!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::439806622",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Self Hug\" emote.\n\nRemember, your survival depends on loving yourself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“自我拥抱”表情!\n记住, 你的生存取决于是否热爱自己。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3962056080",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Snowball\" Emote!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“雪球”表情!\n来一起打雪仗吧!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2219433813",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Tail Wiggle\" emote. Wiggle away, wabbit!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“摇尾巴”表情。 \n尾巴摇起来!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2808478935",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Trick or Treat 1\" emote. Gimme candy, gimme treats… Gimme something good to eat!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“不给糖就捣蛋”一号表情。 \n给我糖果, 给我点心...给我点好吃的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2334819044",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Trick or Treat 2\" emote. Ghosts and goblins—better have treats, or we’ve got problems.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“不给糖就捣蛋”二号表情。 \n幽灵和小妖精们最好有东西吃, 否则我们就有麻烦了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1664057800",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Turkey\" Emote!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“火鸡”表情!\n我是一只鸡...一只鸡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3608911593",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the \"Zombie\" emote.\n\nIt's not just a dance. It's rigor mortis. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可以永久解锁“僵尸”表情。\n这舞有点硬。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1487562124",
      "Source": "Consume this to permanently unlock the style!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个可永久解锁该造型!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
