    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1393689004",
      "Source": "Controlling this armored giant has grown easier, but it will never feel familiar. Though its limbs move as mine do, that is in itself disquieting, and sometimes I get lost in the flashing lights that surround me. \n\nHelena is far more attuned to her giant's abilities than I am, though as in all things, she underestimates herself. Ever since I cast that monstrous old man into the depths, she's been there to pull me back. Not just from the fall, but the abyss itself.\n\nI will still never understand why she was so interested in studying animal excrement when we first met, but after walking this path with her, I can recognize the strength of her spirit. I will do all I can to protect it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"御此甲胄巨人已非难事 然不识其所以也 虽四肢动弹如吾 其不安矣 吾常陷失绕之烨\n\n巨人之力 海莲娜甚善于吾矣 然自视为弱 自吾投怪状老朽入渊以来 海莲娜皆助余 脱难于堕落或乃深渊\n\n初识海莲娜之时 衷心虫兽粪物之钻研 余不知其所以然 作伴以来 深感其精力 誓守之也","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1918348719",
      "Source": "Converts the force of the wind into electricity.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"将风能转化为电能。","JA":""},
