    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::38947114",
      "Source": "Creatures on the island can be tamed and used for multiple reasons such as; Transportation, Hunting, Travelling, Harvesting, Storage, Defense, and Companionship. There are two main methods of taming a creature, Torpor Taming and Passive Taming.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"岛上的生物可以被驯养。不同生物驯养后有许多截然不同的作用, 例如作为交通工具、打猎助手、旅行伴侣、采集能手、储物大师、防御力量以及生活伙伴。目前主要有两种驯养生物的方式: 麻醉驯养、和平驯养。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
