      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4268741428",
      "Source": "Cuts through metal and armor when infused with Element, and supports a Charge Attack. Equipping requires learning this Tekgram",
      "Trans": {"SC":"充能后可以劈开金属和装甲。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
