    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1782038776",
      "Source": "Desert Titan\n\nThe Lord of Sand and Sky has fallen, despite its swarms of protectors, the powerful swings of its mighty tail or the lightning it called from the sky. The soaring leviathan could not match the ingenuity of humanity, and especially not yours.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"沙漠泰坦\r\n\r\n沙子和天空之主已经降临人间。除了其众多的拥趸者外, 它可以挥动其强有力的尾巴或是从天庭召唤雷击。然而这头翱翔天际的神兽却被足智多谋的人类, 尤其是你, 给打败了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
