      "Source": "Drugs",
      "Trans": {"SC":"药品","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3045688267",
      "Source": "Due to the dangers of the ARK, it is critical that you build a shelter to stay protected. You can craft basic structure pieces in your inventory. Upon crafting a structure, you will want to pick a good spot to place it. Consider your location, how close are you to resources? What or who lives nearby? Are there any points of interest you will want to consider? If you think you have found a good spot, you can begin the process of setting up a base. Sometimes, it is better to build right away and move later on when you have advanced further.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"鉴于方舟世界中危机四伏, 强烈建议您建造一处可以提供安全的住所。您可以在物品栏中制作一些基础的建筑结构。一旦制作完毕, 接下来就是挑选放置的位置。您离资源点有多近? 谁在附近出没? 有什么利弊? 如果您觉得找到了一处绝佳的位置, 您就可以开始搭建家园了。有时候, 先立家, 之后再考虑迁移会是比较明智的做法。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3378800053",
      "Source": "Durability",
      "Trans": {"SC":"耐久","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
