      "Trans": {"SC":"消灭","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3454774091",
      "Source": "EXTINCTION",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1711597110",
      "Source": "EXTINCTION\nFinish your journey through the worlds of ARK in Extinction, where the story began and ends: on Earth itself! An Element-infested, ravaged planet filled with fantastical creatures both organic & technological, Earth holds both the secrets of the past and the keys to its salvation. As a veteran Survivor who has conquered all previous obstacles, your ultimate challenge awaits: can you defeat the gigantic roaming Titans which dominate the planet, and complete the ARK cycle to save Earth's future?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"灭绝\n你们将回到地球, 在“灭绝”的世界中见证非凡, 因为这里是一切方舟故事的起源和终焉! 地球, 现在是一颗元素泛滥、饱受蹂躏、遍布科技生物和奇异有机体的星球。作为身经百战的精英生存者, 面前摆着一个终极挑战: 你们是否有能力击败肆虐地球的巨型泰坦, 完成方舟循环, 最终拯救地球的未来?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2088832990",
      "Source": "EXTRA LEVEL STREAMING DISTANCE:",
      "Trans": {"SC":"额外关卡串流距离:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2220719808",
      "Source": "EYE COLOR",
      "Trans": {"SC":"眼珠颜色","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3768828783",
      "Source": "Each one carries with it the seeds of new life - plants, animals and humans - and these seeds will take root across the far corners of the world.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"每一个都携带着孕育新生命的种子 -- 植物、动物以及人类 -- 这些种子将在世界上的角角落落生根发芽。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3247767112",
      "Source": "Early on, I handled all of Nosti's trade negotiations, and I have had trouble growing out of the habit. I suppose that is why every caravan or hunter that passes through our gates knows my name. Some still insist on speaking with me personally, but I do not mind. I find these dealings rather engaging. It is like playing a game of words.\n\nOne such caravan arrived yesterday, bearing a haul of metal ingots. Our venerable Captain has suggested that I bring a contingent of guards to the negotiations, but I would rather not. If our guests are intimated, they may back out, and I would be remiss to waste such an opportunity.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"之前, 我经手诺斯蒂所有的贸易谈判, 我对这件差事爱不释手。我想这就是为什么每一个经过我们大门的商队或猎人都知道我的名字。有些人还是坚持要和我本人对话, 我并不介意。我觉得这些交易相当吸引人。就像在玩一个文字游戏。\n\n昨天有一辆这样的大篷车运来了一批金属锭。我们德高望重的队长建议我调一队卫兵来参加谈判, 但我不同意。如果吓到了我们的客人, 他们可能就不会回来了, 我将不能浪费这样的机会。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1074208592",
      "Source": "Earn XP from Alpha creature kills when equipped, to increase its level and earn additional max-levels for your Survivor!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备后通过击杀精英生物来获得经验值, 以提高其等级并使您的生存者获得额外的最高等级上限!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
