    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::453614276",
      "Source": "Equip a Bronto with this to ride it.  You can build structures on the large platform to make a mobile base.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"装备到雷龙上以骑乘。你可以在上面建造一个移动基地。","JA":""},
