    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3883700255",
      "Source": "FJORDUR:\nExplore a magical Norse-inspired world, and travel to the legendary planes of Asgard, Jotunheim, and Vanaheim. Fjordur features four powerful new creatures for you to tame, including Andrewsarchus, Desmodus, Fjordhawk, and even Fenrir itself! Journey across over 75 square kilometers of new biomes, and face new challenges as you discover over 200 Runes to increase your Survivor's power!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"维京: \n一起来方舟探索这寒冷又严峻的北欧群岛吧! 前往阿斯加德、约顿海姆和瓦纳海姆等平行世界! 此次的全新地图维京有着四种全新的生物供你收集! 通过发现200多处符文来增加生存者的力量! 更囊括了超过75平方公里的新生物群落, 新的挑战, 以及不可错过的景致与探险!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
