    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::352527816",
      "Source": "Far Transition Region",
      "Trans": {"SC":"远端过渡区域","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2365588549",
      "Source": "Far out! This place is kinda like that dream I had.\n\nSo it went like this: I ride some tram thing to like, the biggest, weirdest zoo in the universe, right? Only instead of normal animals, there's dinosaurs! Totally cool...until they all escape just like in every horror movie ever made. Duh! Anyway, Dream-Me hops into a truck with some ripped, badass dudes, and we just start driving around, shooting dinosaurs and stuff. I felt like a legit action hero!\n\nSo I guess this place isn't exactly the same. There's dinosaurs, but I don't have guns or a truck. Also I'm completely alone... \n\nBut it's still just a dream, right? I mean, obviously! I don't even know why I'm writing this down, it's all in my head. All I need to do is walk off that cliff, and I'll wake up right before I hit the ground.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"好酷啊! 这地方和我之前做过的一个梦像极了。\n\n那个梦是这样的: 我坐在一列电车上, 飞驰在全宇宙中最大、最怪异的动物园里。只是那里关的不是普通动物, 而是各种恐龙! 太炫了...然后它们就像恐怖片里的情节一样都跑出来了。\n\n呃! 梦中的我和几个肌肉男跳上了一辆卡车。我们四处驰骋, 啪啪啪各种恐龙。我感觉自己和某个动作明星一模一样!\n\n所以我想说目前的情况不太一样。恐龙是有了, 但我没有枪和车。而且, 我还是一个人...\n\n这只是一场梦, 对不对?  肯定啊! 我都不知道我为什么要写日记, 我不是在做梦么。我只需要跳下那座悬崖, 我就能在落地之前醒过来了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1396644022",
      "Source": "Far's Peak",
      "Trans": {"SC":"远峰","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
