    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3624233314",
      "Source": "Focus hard and flex your muscles, explorer. Be a fusion of strength and speed while you endeavour to defeat the monsters.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"探险者集中精神并大显身手吧。你需要完美融合自己的力量和速度, 努力打败来袭的生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::523171438",
      "Source": "Folks have been spotting a lot more of these wyvern creatures, and they're not just throwing fire every which way, either. Some spit lightning or acid. \n\nOn top of that, those big pillars are acting funny. I checked with Sasha, since she doesn't buy into that Hathor business, and she sees it too. It's making me restless. Between this and the mantises, it's starting to feel like this place wants us gone.\n\nI know that can't be right. There were no spirits of the land to stop the frontiersman back home, and there are none here. Still, I should talk to Raia. If that tower's dangerous, she shouldn't be worshipping it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"最近村民们看到的双足飞龙越来越多, 而且它们不仅仅只喷火。有的还会喷闪电或者强酸。\n\n最麻烦的事情时, 那些巨大的柱子(方尖碑)有点不对劲。我咨询了一下萨沙, 因为她和我一样也不相信这些柱子和哈索尔(埃及神话中的爱神)有什么关系, 她也觉得这事不正常。\n\n这让我不安。介于我们之前还受到过螳螂的袭击, 我开始感觉这个地方想让我们滚出去。\n\n我知道这是不可能的。在我老家可没有什么当地的神灵阻止开荒者的脚步, 这里也不会有。但是我仍然应该找莱雅谈谈。如果那些塔有危险, 她就不应该膜拜那玩意。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
