      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2981020307",
      "Source": "For days, I have prayed for both Hathor's compassion and Sekhmet's healing powers, and for days I have waited. I have faith that they heard me. When I first laid eyes on him, I thought for sure he was dead or dying, but the gods have not yet taken John Dahkeya away from me.\n\nMy mind knows that I have other responsibilities to attend to, that I cannot afford to spend more time in this room. Yet I know that if I attempt to attend to my duties, my heart will interfere and I cannot neglect it. Not any longer.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我已经等待并且祈祷了好几天了, 我向哈索尔祈求她的怜悯, 而向塞赫迈特祈求她的治愈力。我相信她们听到了我的祈祷。当我刚看到他的时候, 我以为他已经死了或是快要死了, 但是众神并没有把约翰·达奇亚从我的身边带走。\n\n我的大脑告诉我我有其他的事情需要处理, 所以我不能再这间房间里面呆更久了。但是我知道, 如果我真的试图去处理其他事情的话, 我的心会扰乱我的思绪, 而我没办法无视它。再也不会了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
