    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1798832851",
      "Source": "Forest Titan\n\nSo succumbs the Lord of the Forest, the titan wreathed in green, who lashed out with root and vine to pin its foes to the ground or drag them to their doom. The forest itself rose to shield it, but even that could not save it. Not from you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"森林泰坦\r\n\r\n臣服于森林之主! 这位泰坦身披绿色铠甲, 能释放出根须和藤曼将敌人按在地上或是拖拽到身边。一草一木亲自为其提供护盾, 然而这还是无法拯救它, 至少你不行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3284889385",
      "Source": "Forest Titan Saddle",
