    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4216452060",
      "Source": "GENESIS",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世纪1","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::979661852",
      "Source": "GENESIS 2",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世纪2","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3438582557",
      "Source": "GENESIS: PART 1\nContinue your quest for ultimate survival and unlock a whole new chapter in the saga of ARK: Survival Evolved! Waking up inside a virtual simulation, with a strangely familiar robotic companion, you must overcome rigorous missions to survive across multiple exotic worlds unlike anything you've seen before!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世纪: 第一部\n继续你对终极生存的追求之路, 开启《方舟: 生存进化》的全新篇章! 你在一个虚拟现实中醒来, 与一位异常熟悉的机器人作伴。你必须完成严苛的任务, 以求在数个前所未见的异域世界中成功存活!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::22459283",
      "Source": "GENESIS: PART 2\nComplete the eons-spanning story of ARK: Survival Evolved! Everything that your tribe has built, tamed, and fought for has led to this final challenge. With your faithful artificial companion HLN-A by your side, you’ve emerged from the Genesis simulation to find yourself aboard a gigantic starship being overtaken by a familiar threat from the distant past. Humanity’s future is in your hands, Survivor -- one last time!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"创世纪: 第二部\n完成这一场《方舟: 生存进化》中跨时代的故事! 一直以来你所建立的部落, 所驯服的生物和为之奋斗的一切都是为了这一最终挑战。在你忠实的伙伴 HLN-A 的陪伴下, 你成功从创世模拟系统中走了出来, 发现自己登上了一艘巨大的飞船, 一个来自遥远的过去的你所熟悉的威胁正在降临。人类的未来掌握在你的手中, 生存者——最后一战!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
