    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::730084724",
      "Source": "Have you been naughty?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你有没有淘气啊?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::686490676",
      "Source": "Have you been nice?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你有没有乖乖的啊?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2038485374",
      "Source": "Having readily available subjects has helped my experiments tremendously, even if their numbers dwindled over time. Not only was I able to curb the side effects of my Fria Curry's endothermic properties, but I managed to bring out an additional benefit of the mixture. Now it also lowers the subject's metabolism, letting them go longer without needing food. Marvelous! I hadn't even considered that as a possibility.\n\nWhy, with all I've learned from these experiments, I imagine that I could reverse the effects of the Curry and create a concoction to aid survival in extreme heat as well! I must find more volunteers posthaste.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现成可用的试验体给我的试验带来了莫大的帮助, 虽然人数随时间在不断减少。我不仅成功抑制了菲拉咖喱的吸热特性带来的副作用, 还找到了该混合物的一个附加疗效。\n\n现在它还能减缓新陈代谢, 让使用者行动更久而不用进食。太奇妙了! 我都没想到这种可能性。\n\n这是为什么呢, 在这些试验中学到的知识让我联想到, 也许我可以反转菲拉咖喱的药效从而发明出一种可以帮助人们在极端炎热条件下生存的药剂。我一定要马上找到更多的志愿者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2240994899",
      "Source": "Having seen us through the ruins and safely to the platform, Wali has taken her leave. After doing so much for me, I was sad to see her go, but at least I got her to smile before she left. Well, me and Radar. I can't very well take the little critter with me, so I officially gave Wali ownership of her. They'll be good for each other, I think.\n\nGah, I wrote \"Wali\" up there. Twice! I suppose old habits die hard, but it's not really her name, is it? I always knew that was the case, but she'd never told me to call her anything else. At least not until now.\n\nWell at any rate – cheers, Raia. It was a pleasure to have known you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"带领我们穿过废墟并安全地抵达了传送平台后, 瓦力就准备离开了。在她为我做了这么多之后, 看着她离开让我很伤心, 但至少在她离开之前, 我给了她一个惊喜。\n\n好吧, 是我和雷达。我不太可能带着这个小可爱一起离开, 所以我把她送给了瓦力。我想她们能够相处融洽。\n\n哎呀, 我一直都写的是“瓦力”! 还写了两次! 我想旧习难改吧, 但这又不是她的真名不是吗? 我早就知道该是如此, 但是她从没有让我改口叫她的真名。至少一直到现在为止没有。\n\n好吧不管怎样——再见了, 拉亚。很高兴认识你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4250155927",
      "Source": "Hawaiian Shirt",
      "Trans": {"SC":"夏威夷衫","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3747616923",
      "Source": "Hazard",
      "Trans": {"SC":"防护","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2903331431",
      "Source": "He Protec",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他守护","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3937442200",
      "Source": "He is mine. After a mighty struggle, the power of the Demon King is now mine to unleash.\n\nThe cost was almost too great. I brought only my swiftest beasts on the hunt, hoping to run him in circles, but even still he managed to kill many of them. Were it not for Wuzhui, he may have killed me as well, but my Wuzhui is both swift and cunning. He knew exactly what distance to maintain, exactly when to retreat. No steed could prove more true.\n\nTomorrow I must begin acclimating the Demon King to life in my pack, but for tonight, I will allow myself to celebrate.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"其为吾之所有, 大战挣扎过后, 魔兽之力, 已可为吾所使。\n\n此中代价巨大, 为捕斯也。吾仅携最迅速之众兽, 望以圈而囚之, 终了其杀吾兽数只。若非乌骓, 吾亦死于其手, 然吾之乌骓快而狡, 知当保持距离, 亦知何时当撤。无它坐骑更精于此。\n\n明日吾当驯此魔兽之王, 使其归吾之队, 然今夜, 吾将庆而祝之。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
