      "Source": "Holson Creek",
      "Trans": {"SC":"霍尔森河","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2729567795",
      "Source": "Holy crap, I have a laser gun! An actual, real ass, pew-pew laser gun!\n\nOkay, okay, so check it out: turns out there were way more of these buildings than we thought, like a small town's worth. Whoever actually used them was long gone way before we got here, but they left behind a ton of sweet gear. There's even these crazy space beds that helped Imamu heal the wounds he got from Boris. Wish Emilia was here to help figure out how all this stuff works... \n\nWell anyway, we're gonna use this place as our new home base while we go searching for these artifacts. Between Imamu's pets and these badass new guns, things are finally looking up!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我靠, 我拿到了一把激光枪! 一把真真正正的、劲爆的、会biu~biu~的激光枪!\n\n冷静, 冷静, 是这样的: 原来还有很多像这样的建筑物, 差不多有一个小镇的规模。不管是谁在使用, 他们都在我们抵达很久之前就不在了, 但是他们留下了很多炫酷的装备。\n\n甚至还有一些太空床, 它治愈了伊玛目被鲍里斯攻击所受的伤。希望伊米莉亚也在这里, 她能搞清楚这些东西是如何工作的...\n\n不管怎么说, 我们打算在搜寻这些神器的时候, 把这个地方作为我们的新基地。我们有伊玛目的宠物和这些新枪, 事态终于往好的方面发展了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::768800460",
      "Source": "Home Is Where the Pouch Is",
      "Trans": {"SC":"袋子在哪里, 家就在哪里。","JA":""},
