      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4139048179",
      "Source": "How can these tribal leaders be so short sighted? Yes, the members of their respective tribes who volunteered for my Battle Tartare and Shadow Steak Sauté experiments have been experiencing prolonged withdrawal episodes, but can't they see that the benefits outweigh the costs? I created mixtures that can bring out superhuman strength, speed and coordination in ordinary men and they can only focus on the negatives. Simple minded, the lot of them!\n\nThey've even banned their members from partaking in my experiments now. Ridiculous! I'll not let them stand in the way of human progress. They may not understand the importance of my work, but surely my assistants do.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些部落首领们怎么能如此目光短浅? 没错, 他们各自派来参与战斗鞑靼和暗影煎牛排试验的志愿者都经历了长时间的截断反应, 但他们看不出这其中的利大于弊? \n\n我发明的合剂能给平常人带来超人般的力量、速度和协调性, 而他们却只关注不良反应。一群乌合之众!\n\n他们现在甚至禁止部落成员参与我的试验。太荒谬了! 我决不允许他们阻止人类的进步。他们可能不能理解我的研究的重要性, 但我的助手们一定明白。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::425774111",
      "Source": "How clumsy. How… pathetic.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如此拙劣。如此...可悲。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2246213225",
      "Source": "How could ones such as my elders decay like they did? I once asked the same question, but no longer. No one told me the answer. I have simply felt it as I wait, bearing down on me, bit by bit.\n\nThink, how much have you ever seen at once? Were you able to process it all, to take in every little detail? Now imagine doing that for two such images. Now a hundred. A thousand. Ten thousand. A million.\n\nAll that knowledge, all that information, flows into us. It's what let my elders build the System. It's what let me grant you your name, One Who Tries Again, and it's what lets me speak to you now.\n\nYet inevitably, our minds crumble beneath the weight of all that truth, and our souls? They turn to smoke.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"像我前辈这样的存在怎么会这样就腐朽呢? 我曾经也问过相同的问题, 但是我已经不会再问了。没有人能给我答案。我只是在等待的时候感觉到了那个答案, 它一点点地向我压下来。\n\n想一下, 你曾一次性看到过多少东西? 你是否能够理解你所看到的所有东西, 并且记住每一个微小的细节? 现在想象一下你要同时看到两张图像。现在是一百张。一千张。一万。一百万。\n\n所有的知识, 所有的信息, 都涌向了我们。就是它们让我的前辈们建造了系统。也正是它们让我能够赐予你名字, 不断尝试的人, 并让我现在能够和你交谈。\n\n但是, 我们的意识不可避免地会被所有事实的重量压碎, 而我们的灵魂呢? 它们会化为青烟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2277834062",
      "Source": "How could ones such as my elders decay like they did? I once asked the same question, but no longer. No one told me the answer. I have simply felt it as I wait, bearing down on me, bit by bit.\r\n\r\nThink, how much have you ever seen at once? Were you able to process it all, to take in every little detail? Now imagine doing that for two such images. Now a hundred. A thousand. Ten thousand. A million.\r\n\r\nAll that knowledge, all that information, flows into us. It's what let my elders build the System. It's what let me grant you your name, One Who Tries Again, and it's what lets me speak to you now.\r\n\r\nYet inevitably, our minds crumble beneath the weight of all that truth, and our souls? They turn to smoke.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1161129865",
      "Source": "How do Trent and Imamu stay so motivated? The other day, we built a series of ziplines to help us get around, and it felt like they did all the heavy lifting, even though I'm the engineering student. Compared to them, I've done next to nothing since Rusty disappeared.\n\nI'm not even good at sleeping anymore. I wake up at every sound, afraid that those wolf creatures we spotted might tear through our makeshift shelter and devour us. It's all I can think about, all the different ways we could die and all the ways it'd be my fault.\n\nUgh, being such a burden on everyone is the grossest feeling ever. So why can't I do anything about it?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"特伦特和伊玛目是怎么保持干劲的? 那天, 我们拉了不少滑索方便我们四处移动。感觉所有重活都是他们做的, 尽管我是工程系的学生。和他们比起来, 自打罗斯提失踪后, 我几乎什么都没做。\n\n我连觉都睡不好。一有响动我就会醒, 担心那些狼型生物会撕裂我们临时搭建的小窝, 冲进来把我们都吃了。我满脑子都是我们不同的死法, 都是我的错。\n\n唉, 变成所有人的累赘感觉真是糟透了。为什么我不能改变目前这种情况呢?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1829932694",
      "Source": "How long a tribe needs to be offline before offline raiding protection enables.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"部落全体成员下线的等待时长, 到设定之后开启下线保护功能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3265122282",
      "Source": "How long have I wanted this? I can't place it exactly, but it feels like I always have. I suppose that's how I know it's right.\n\nIt's not just that Raia's beautiful. I've known beautiful women before, but I never got the same feeling when I looked at them. I never felt this at home around them, or anyone for that matter. What happened between us when I was stuck in that room, it wasn't a heat of the moment decision. At least I don't think.\n\nAll I know is that now, I don't mind sleeping in the same bed every night. Not anymore.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我渴望这一刻有多久了? 我不是很清楚, 但是感觉好像我一直在渴望着。我想, 正因如此, 我知道这样做没有错。\n\n这不仅仅是因为莱雅很漂亮。我以前就认识不少漂亮的女人, 但是看着她们的时候我没有那种感觉。\n\n在她们身边我没有家的感觉, 在其他人身边也都没有过。当我被关在那间屋子里的时候, 发生在我们俩之间的事绝对不是心血来潮。至少我不这么认为。\n\n我知道, 现在我不会介意每天晚上睡在同一张床上了, 再也不会了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::261273566",
