    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1361924002",
      "Source": "If checked, Diseases will not be permanent (player characters will then lose diseases when they respawn).",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 疾病将不是永久性的(玩家角色重生后可被治愈)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1668830035",
      "Source": "If checked, Friendly Fire (among tribemates, tribe dinos, tribe structures) is disabled in PvE.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, PVE模式下禁用友军伤害(包括部落伙伴、恐龙和建筑物)。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::241870421",
      "Source": "If checked, RPG-style pop-up text will appear\ndisplaying damage numbers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 屏幕上会出现浮动伤害数字。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2407322840",
      "Source": "If checked, a tamed Titanosaur will consume\nfood in its inventory and stay alive\n(Titanosaur normally starves to death to\nprevent any player or tribe from owning it\nforever).",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 被驯服的泰坦龙将会开始进食。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1345570902",
      "Source": "If checked, allows building in caves when PvE mode is also enabled.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, PVE模式下允许在洞穴中建造。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::279116077",
      "Source": "If checked, any Engram not explicitly\nspecified in the Engrams list will be hidden.\nAll Items and Blueprints based on hidden\nEngrams will be removed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 任何未在技能列表中\n选择的技能都将被隐藏。所有被\n隐藏的物品和蓝图都将被移除。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::899501197",
      "Source": "If checked, dinosaurs not on a flier's\n\"team\" (tribe or ally) can stand on the flier\nplatform. Otherwise, they slide off.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 非部落或盟友的恐龙可以站在\n飞行单位的平台上。若不勾选, 它们将\n会从平台上滑落。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1222735701",
      "Source": "If checked, everyone is allowed to \"take care\"\nof a Baby Dino, including cuddling, not just the\nplayer character who imprinted the Baby.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 所有人都可以看到并完成留痕任务。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2005628021",
      "Source": "If checked, players can create their own\nrecipes and cook custom foods using the\nrecipes.",
