    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4186515165",
      "Source": "If checked, tribes may cancel an agreed-upon war before it has actually started.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 部落可以在战争开始前取消已接受的宣战请求。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4271431356",
      "Source": "If checked, turrets and spikes can be built and operate on platform saddles.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勾选后, 平台鞍上可以放置炮塔和拒马。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3375515182",
      "Source": "If nothing else, my own sessions have been a moment of peace. I still don't want to pilot one of my own masterpieces in combat, but when it's just me and my MEK in the hangar, I feel like I can finally relax.\n\nIt's not just that I've been working long hours. I did that plenty of times on the Gateway Project, and our TEK bomb before then. It's that I'm working long hours and dealing with people at the same time, all the time. The pilot sessions have been getting better, but running everything else on top of that?\n\n\"Santiago, a water pipe broke. Santiago, so and so is hogging all the ammo.\" Constant interruptions.\n\nMaybe I'll just hide in the cockpit and nap for a while. No one would know...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我让自己进行操作训练是为了追求片刻的宁静。我仍然不想在战斗中驾驶自己的杰作, 但是当机库里只有我和我的机甲时, 我终于觉得可以放松下来了。\n\n不只是因为长时间工作。我在之前的星门计划和泰克炸弹上也常常昼夜奋战。只是我又要长时间工作, 同时又要一直处理各种杂事。机甲驾驶培训的情况越来越好, 但除此之外还有一堆杂七杂八的事情。\n\n“圣地亚哥, 水管坏了。圣地亚哥, 弹药不够了。”各种干扰。\n\n或许我可以躲在驾驶舱里小睡一会儿。没人会知道的...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3744811832",
      "Source": "If you go too fast you might not notice everything.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如果你走得太快, 你可能不会注意到任何事。","JA":""},
