    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3356981365",
      "Source": "King Titan",
      "Trans": {"SC":"君王泰坦","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3778531437",
      "Source": "King Titan\nThough he could scatter his foes with a single charge, roar or swipe of his tail, and call fire down from the sky itself, in the end you banished the King of Shadows. No matter how many corrupted beasts he summoned or how many weapons he rendered useless, he could not snuff you out - for you fought with the hopes of the human race on your shoulders, and its tenacity at your back.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"君王泰坦\r\n\r\n虽然他可以使用冲撞、咆哮或扫尾击飞他的敌人们, 还能够从天空召唤烈火炙烤对手, 但你最终还是成功击败了这位暗影之王。\n\n不管他拥有多少腐化仆从或是无视多少武器的攻击, 他仍然无法打败你。因为你肩负了全人类的希望, 是它给了你屡败屡战的坚韧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
