    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2021567697",
      "Source": "LOST ISLAND:\nExplore the soaring heights and hidden depths of Lost Island, featuring three powerful new creatures for you to tame. Discover jungle valleys fed by giant waterfalls, build a treehouse high in the forest canopies, get down and dirty in vast mangrove swamps, dive deep underwater, brave treacherous snowy peaks, or spelunk uncharted cave systems in search of treasure... whichever way you go, wild adventure awaits!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"失落之岛:\n探索失落之岛霄汉的高空以及深邃的低谷吧! 三种强大的全新的生物可供你驯服! 快来发现由巨大瀑布滋养的丛林山谷, 在高大的森林树冠上建造树屋, 在红树林沼泽里跌打翻滚, 在清凉的水下深潜, 勇敢地挑战险峻的雪峰, 又或是在未知的洞穴中寻宝...总会有一款适合你!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
