    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::624368790",
      "Source": "Looks like someone's aiming for the perfect holiday dinner. \n\nYou can use this to skin the appearance of a shirt into an ugly holiday sweater. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变上衣的外观使其变成难看的节日毛衣。看起来有人想要一顿完美的假日晚餐。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3240564230",
      "Source": "Looks like we made it just in time. I backtracked to take a peek at the surface, and it's just one big fire. That's not a metaphor, I mean it's actually burning.\n\nI guess some combination of the radiation that's leaking through the barrier and reflected sunlight is turning it into our own private hellscape. That's not exactly the kind of thing you want in your backyard, so the plan is to keep delving into these caverns.\n\nThe good news is that they're way bigger than we ever thought. We should be able to set up a pretty extensive base of operations, and after that...better not think that far ahead. Chin up and eyes forward, soldier.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"看来我们及时赶到了。我原路返回去看了一眼地表, 外面大火肆虐。这不是比喻, 它真的是在燃烧。\n\n我猜测是漏过结界的辐射和太阳光线把它变成一个烈焰地狱。这绝对不是你见到的情况, 所以我们打算继续深入这些洞穴。\n\n好消息是它们比我们预想中的要大得多。我们应该能够建立一个相当完备的行动基地, 在那之后...最好不要想太远。昂首挺胸向前看吧, 士兵。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
