    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2410768332",
      "Source": "Lost souls from all across the desert continue to prostrate themselves before Nosti's gates. I adamantly refuse to turn away anyone that does not mean us any harm, but I realize that has left us with many mouths to feed.\n\nAs a result, Nosti's fields are its most valuable asset. Fortunately, Girisha's designs and my organization of labor and resources have once again proven effective. Not only did we implement an efficient irrigation system, but we have encased our crops in a large, protective structure made of a clear, shiny substance called \"glass.\"\n\nEvery morning, it sparkles with Amun-Ra's light like a great gem, a beautiful reminder of what we can accomplish when we are united in purpose.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"来自四面八方的孤魂, 穿过沙漠, 匍伏在诺斯蒂的大门前。我坚决不肯驱逐那些对我们无害的人们, 但我清楚意识到, 这意味着又有更多张嘴要喂。\n\n诺斯蒂的田地变成了最贵重的财产。幸运的是, 吉里什的设计和我对劳力和资源的管理再次体现了价值。我们不仅建造了一个高效的灌溉系统, 而且还把我们的庄稼包裹在一个由一种叫做“玻璃”的透明物质构成的保护型建筑物中。\n\n每天早上, 它如同一个巨大的宝石, 闪烁着太阳神的光。它提醒着我们一个道理: 只要心向一处, 就能完成壮举。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1502664199",
      "Source": "Lost souls from all across the desert continue to prostrate themselves before Nosti's gates. I adamantly refuse to turn away anyone that does not mean us any harm, but I realize that has left us with many mouths to feed.\r\n\r\nAs a result, Nosti's fields are its most valuable asset. Fortunately, Girisha's designs and my organization of labor and resources have once again proven effective. Not only did we implement an efficient irrigation system, but we have encased our crops in a large, protective structure made of a clear, shiny substance called \"glass.\"\r\n\r\nEvery morning, it sparkles with Amun-Ra's light like a great gem, a beautiful reminder of what we can accomplish when we are united in purpose.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Lost souls from all across the desert continue to prostrate themselves before Nosti's gates. I adamantly refuse to turn away anyone that does not mean us any harm, but I realize that has left us with many mouths to feed.\r\n\r\nAs a result, Nosti's fields are its most valuable asset. Fortunately, Girisha's designs and my organization of labor and resources have once again proven effective. Not only did we implement an efficient irrigation system, but we have encased our crops in a large, protective structure made of a clear, shiny substance called \"glass.\"\r\n\r\nEvery morning, it sparkles with Amun-Ra's light like a great gem, a beautiful reminder of what we can accomplish when we are united in purpose.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
