    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1386441017",
      "Source": "Nameless Queen",
      "Trans": {"SC":"无名怪女王","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2431029285",
      "Source": "Names are a curious thing. We assign them great weight, yet they do not change the substance of the person, place or thing they belong to.\n\nI suppose that line of thinking is why I never dwelled on the name of our humble village, yet now that it has grown to become somewhat less humble, our home can go nameless no longer. People must call it something.\n\nTo that end, Nosti is as good a name as any. I am told that it means \"to know\" in some old, important language, and whatever our citizens intended that to symbolize when they chose it, I know this: while we are here, we are under the protection of the gods.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"名字是个神奇的东西。我们赋予了它沉重的含义, 但它们不会改变人、地方或事物的本质。\n\n我想这就是为什么我从来没有考虑给我们这个简陋的村庄起个名字, 但现在不同了, 我们的家不能再没有名字了。提到它的时候, 人们必须喊点什么。\n\n那就叫诺斯蒂好了。据说它在某种古老的语言里代表“知道”。不管我们的居民出于何种目的要选择它, 我知道这一点: 我们待在这里, 我们便受到神的保护。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::795359538",
      "Source": "Nasrin is quite different from her husband. She is a timid little flower of a woman, or rather, she would be if she were not many months pregnant. \n\nI am still undecided as to whether my timing is impeccable or unfortunate. A few weeks from now, Timur may have had no need of a doctor, but as it stands I have been thrust into an unfamiliar scenario with scant time to prepare.\n\nDespite my unpleasant circumstances, this whole affair is rather intriguing. I never considered the possibility of new generations being born on the ARK, yet clearly it was inevitable. Like any common animal, humans have the urge to procreate. How else could the species endure?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"娜斯林和她的丈夫完全不同。她是一个娇羞的小花一般的女人, 或者更确切的说, 在她怀有多月身孕之前。\n\n我还是不确定到底自己出现的时机是好是坏。几周之后, 帖木儿可能就不需要医生了, 不过目前的情况是我不得不去面对一个陌生的领域, 并且根本没有时间准备。\n\n尽管我的现状堪忧, 但这整件事还是相当有趣的。我从来没有考虑过方舟上诞生新一代的可能性, 但显然这是不可避免的。像任何的动物一样, 人类也有生育的本能。不然物种如何延续下去?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1482875360",
      "Source": "Nataziel Spires",
      "Trans": {"SC":"纳塔齐尔尖岩","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
