    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2793630377",
      "Source": "Odd Couple Swim Bottom",
      "Trans": {"SC":"奇怪的情侣泳裤","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1590575204",
      "Source": "Odd Couple Swim Top",
      "Trans": {"SC":"奇怪的情侣泳衣","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3701870938",
      "Source": "Of all the abnormalities that I've observed, the tamed megalodons stick out to me. It was almost like they were stray dogs who were resocialized, as though they had a genetic history of human obedience.\n\nMost of my observations have been in the wild, but I think I may learn a thing or two if I observe domesticated creatures more closely. I need to study their diets, their mating patterns, how they socialize with other species...all that.\n\nRumor has it that there's some woman that's tamed a whole mess of them all by herself, so many that they call her the Beast Queen of the Jungle. Maybe she'll have some useful insights.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在我观察到的所有异常情况中, 驯化的巨齿鲨最让我在意。它们好像是重新回归的流浪犬, 仿佛骨子就有服从人类的基因。\n\n我大部分时候的观察是在野外进行的, 但是我觉得如果更加仔细地观察一下家养生物, 我能有点收获。我需要研究它们的饮食、交配方式、社交等诸如此类的事情。\n\n有传言说某位女性独自驯化了一大群生物, 多到他们都称呼她为: 兽林女王。或许她会有一些有用的见解。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2939809847",
      "Source": "Offhand",
      "Trans": {"SC":"副手","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1687531787",
      "Source": "Official Dedicated ARKs",
      "Trans": {"SC":"官方专用方舟","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1360457228",
      "Source": "Oh baby, did I miss real speed! And the sky! Missed you too, beautiful. That prototype jetpack might not compare to my fighter, but the rush I got was way better than I'd hoped. Guess I've been stuck here for longer than I thought.\n\nSantiago's been joking about how much I owe him, but he's more right than he knows. I promised to bring him some music for the ride back to civilization. Least I can do for that little nerd.\n\nThe full set of armor should be done by next week. Then it's finally showtime.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"噢, 宝贝, 我真怀念这种飞驰的感觉! 还有天空! 太想你了, 你真美丽啊。虽然这个装甲原型可能比不上我的战斗机, 但是比想象中的要刺激得多了。我想我应该是在这里被困太久了。\n\n圣地亚哥一直在开玩笑说我欠他多少情, 但这已经超出了人情的范畴了。我答应他等我从文明世界回来, 会给他带些音乐。至少这是我能为那个小书呆尽得绵薄之力了。\n\n全套装甲应该可以在下周前完成。压轴节目即将上演。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2782258152",
      "Source": "Oh man, that's really got you good!\nNo worries.\nJust, uh...hang in there for a second.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦, 老兄, 知道你还好真是太棒了。\n别担心。\n只是, 嗯...在那儿再坚持一会儿。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2251407339",
      "Source": "Oh no! You didn't find the egg in time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不! 你没能及时找到那颗蛋","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::615439434",
      "Source": "Oh no! You didn't find them in time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不! 你没能及时找到它们","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3157619132",
      "Source": "Oh no! You didn't return the baby in time",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不! 你没能及时将宝宝送回去","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1184926314",
      "Source": "Oh no, you have Bog Stank! You are feeling like you might pass out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"哦不, 你得了沼泽恶臭症! 你感觉自己快要晕过去了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3309008399",
      "Source": "Oh, Rusty, you idiot. If I ever get the chance to return this journal, I want you to know that we always trusted you. We were just worried about the pressure you put on yourself. Even Trent misses you, despite all of his stupid, alpha male chest thumping. \n\nBoris is the real jerk here. Everyone else wants to look for you, but he keeps insisting that it's not worth it. How can he be so heartless? It's like he's a robot or something. He hardly even seems frightened by this place! I wish I could say this same. I feel like I'm trapped in a nightmare, and each day it gets worse.\n\nPlease be out there, Rusty. We need to stick together and find a way home. God, I just want go home...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗斯提你个傻瓜。如果我有机会归还这个日记, 我想让你知道我们一直都相信你。我们只是担心你给自己施加的压力太多。就连特伦特都想念你——虽然他又蠢又有大男子主义。\n\n鲍里斯才是这里真正的混蛋。大家都想去找你, 但是只有他坚持说这么做不值。他怎么可以这么无情? 就好像是个机器人。他一点都没有被这个地方吓到! 我希望我也能这样。我感觉我好像陷入了一个噩梦之中, 越来越糟糕。\n\n求求你别死, 罗斯提。我们需要团结在一起, 共同找到回家的办法。老天爷, 我只想回家...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2491856712",
      "Source": "Oh? Hello there!\nNow what are you two little gnats up to, hm?\nThis is to be my world, the first of many...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"嗷?  你们好啊!\n现在你们两个小虫子在干什么, 嗯? \n这里是我的地盘, 我的第一片地盘...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
