    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1219737175",
      "Source": "Only eat this dish in the dark.  It causes the light receptors in your eyes to become hyperactive, improves your hand-eye coordination, and allows your body to ignore extreme temperatures.\nWarning: this concoction can be habit-forming.\n\n1 serving of Cooked Prime Meat\n2 handful of Mejoberries\n2 dollops of Narcotic\n2 Rare Mushrooms\n1 Savoroot\n1 Rockarrot\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建议只在黑暗中才吃这道菜。它会导致你眼里的光线接收器变得活跃, 提高你的手眼协调能力, 并让你的身体可以忽略极端温度。\n警告: 这种混合物有成瘾性\n\n1份优质熟肉\n2把紫色浆果\n2勺麻醉药\n2个稀有蘑菇\n1个土豆\n1个胡萝卜\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1892563919",
      "Source": "Only eat this dish when you intend to go into a brawl.  It causes pain and stress to your body, but grants you almost supernatural strength, speed, and resilience.\nWarning: this concoction can be habit-forming.\n\n1 serving of Raw Prime Meat\n2 handful of Mejoberries\n2 dollops of Stimulant\n2 Rare Flowers\n1 Citronal\n1 Longrass\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"建议只在准备打架时吃这道菜。虽然它会给你的身体带来痛苦和压力, 但是会给予你超自然的力量, 速度和韧性。\n警告: 这种混合物有成瘾性。\n\n1份优质生肉\n2份紫色浆果\n2勺兴奋剂\n2个稀有花朵\n1个柠檬\n1个玉米\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
