    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1155669967",
      "Source": "Put a battery in inventory, or a pet on shoulder to harvest Charge",
      "Trans": {"SC":"给跨步者与玩家背包内的电池或在肩上携带的发光宠物充电","JA":""},
