    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1098463580",
      "Source": "RAGNAROK:\nJourney through an expansive 144 sq. kilometer fantasty highland, where common and all-new biomes are combined to bring the ultimate survivor experience. Whether tackling the extreme cold atop the highest mountains, harvesting resources from an active volcano, or just searching for that perfect base location, Ragnarok plays host to explorers and base builders alike. But survivors beware, Ragnarok houses such creatures as Polar Bears, Ice Wyverns, and a mystical creature many have yet to tame in the ARK universe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"仙境: \n踏上穿越了144平方公里广袤天地的旅程, 为你带来终极生存者的体验, 这里整合了孤岛、焦土的所有新生物群落元素。无论是应对最高山峰顶端的极寒, 在活火山采集资源, 还是寻找完美的基地位置, 仙境都是志同道合的探险者和基地建造者的大本营。不过生存者们切记, 仙境里不仅生活着北极熊、寒冰飞龙等物种, 甚至还有方舟宇宙里大多数人还未能驯服的神秘生物。仙境的大量独有特色包括: 自定义探险者笔记, 富有挑战性的地牢, 地牢首领, 活动温泉, 特有的可捡起/可采集资源, 新生物群系, 一座活火山, 独特的树屋平台位置, 环境陷阱, 独特的遗迹, 以及更多, 尽在这个美丽的新世界等待你来探索。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::245065825",
      "Source": "RAGNAROK:\r\nJourney through an expansive 144 sq. kilometer fantasy highland, where common and all-new biomes are combined to bring the ultimate survivor experience. Whether tackling the extreme cold atop the highest mountains, harvesting resources from an active volcano, or just searching for that perfect base location, Ragnarok plays host to explorers and base builders alike. But survivors beware, Ragnarok houses such creatures as Polar Bears, Ice Wyverns, and a mystical creature many have yet to tame in the ARK universe.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"RAGNAROK:\r\nJourney through an expansive 144 sq. kilometer fantasy highland, where common and all-new biomes are combined to bring the ultimate survivor experience. Whether tackling the extreme cold atop the highest mountains, harvesting resources from an active volcano, or just searching for that perfect base location, Ragnarok plays host to explorers and base builders alike. But survivors beware, Ragnarok houses such creatures as Polar Bears, Ice Wyverns, and a mystical creature many have yet to tame in the ARK universe.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
