      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3261319549",
      "Source": "Remarkable! Absolutely remarkable! When I chose that remote northern cave as the site of my spectacular spelunking sojourn, I'd never imagined that I'd find such wonders within. Granted, I don't know what this specific wonder does exactly, but it's fascinating to examine. It's like nothing I've ever seen! I don't even recognize the materials that it's composed of, and it's constantly pulsing with some kind of latent energy. What is it? Is it unique or are there similar artifacts just waiting to be discovered beneath the island's surface?\n\nMy, how invigorating! Isabelle was right, this was exactly what I needed. I feel like a young man again!  ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"了不起! 实在是了不起! 当我决定去那个偏远的北方山洞进行这次洞穴大冒险之旅时, 根本没想到会在里面找到这样的奇迹。诚然, 我尚且不清楚这这个奇迹到底能做什么, 但研究它太令人着迷了。\n\n我从未见过类似的东西! 我甚至无法辨认它是由什么物质构成的, 而且它还会不断随某种潜在的能量而震动。这究竟是什么? 它是独一无二的吗? 还是表象之下这岛上还有类似的神器就等着我去发现? \n\n天呐, 太令人振奋了! 伊莎贝尔说的没错, 这正是我所需要的。我有一种返老还童的感觉!  ","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::952945940",
      "Source": "Remembrance (Medium)",
      "Trans": {"SC":"纪念地 (中等)","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
