    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2891412912",
      "Source": "Rips through metal and armor when infused with Element and can chain hits to temporarily increase their speed and damage. Equipping this requires learning its Tekgram.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"注入了能量元素的光刃, 可以破坏金属和护甲。连续攻击后可暂时提高攻击速度和伤害。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可装备。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
