    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3133549064",
      "Source": "SCORCHED EARTH",
      "Trans": {"SC":"焦土","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1056096945",
      "Source": "SCORCHED EARTH:\nPut your survival skills to the test as you find yourself stranded naked, dehydrated & starving in a vast desert. Even the most seasoned ARK survivors must quickly find water, hunt for food, harvest, craft items, and build shelter to have any chance for survival. Use skills honed on ARK's Island to kill, tame, breed, and ride the fantastical new creatures that have evolved to survive the Desert's ultra harsh conditions, including... DRAGONS!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"焦土: \n赤身裸体地被困在一片广袤的沙漠中, 又饥又渴, 即便是最老练的方舟生存者, 想要存活下来也必须迅速找到水源, 寻找食物, 采集资源, 制作道具并且搭建栖身之处。用从遥远的孤岛上磨炼出的技能来击杀, 驯养, 繁育和骑乘这些在沙漠超严苛条件下进化求存的神秘新生物, 其中包括...双足翼龙!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
