    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1868473371",
      "Source": "Second Place",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第二名","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2177643306",
      "Source": "Second among his lieutenants is the white giant of wind and rime, the Lord of Winter. It rules over the land of snow, but its breath is more frigid than any of the storms that howl across its domain. All who feel it turn to ice, frozen and unmoving.\n\nA feral creature, it's more ravenous than the others. More beastlike. It's happy to tear and shred with fangs and claws, or impale its prey on spears of ice. To stalk, to kill...this desire consumes it, and it will follow that creed until there is no prey left to devour.\n\nFind its lair, turn the hunt upon the hunter and let the long winter thaw.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"他的第二名副官是带来暴风与冰霜的白色巨人, 冬日的领主。它统治着雪域, 但它的呼吸要比它领土中肆虐的风暴更加寒冷。所有触碰到它呼出的气息的人都会变成冰块, 被冻住后就动不了了。\n\n它是一个凶残的生物, 要比其他的泰坦更加贪婪。更像是一头野兽。它喜欢用獠牙和爪子撕扯并粉碎它的猎物, 或是用冰矛刺穿它们。追踪、杀戮...这种欲望吞噬了它, 而它会一直遵循这种欲望, 直到再也没有可以供它吞噬的猎物为止。\n\n找到它的巢穴, 让猎人变成猎物, 并解冻这场漫漫长冬。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
