    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2106114728",
      "Source": "Shooting hoops, just like on the playground...only there's a dodo instead of a ball. Ignore the dodo's complaints and score 10 points before the timer runs out. Hey, if the dodo doesn't like it, it should have learned to fly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"和普通投篮一样...只不过这里把篮球换成了渡渡鸟。不用搭理它们的抱怨声, 在时限内获得10分。如果渡渡鸟不喜欢被当成球, 那它们本可以飞走呀。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2844706254",
      "Source": "Shooting hoops, just like on the playground...only there's a dodo instead of a ball. Ignore the dodo's complaints and score 25 points before the timer runs out. Hey, if the dodo doesn't like it, it should have learned to fly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"和普通投篮一样...只不过这里把篮球换成了渡渡鸟。不用搭理它们的抱怨声, 在时限内获得25分。如果渡渡鸟不喜欢被当成球, 那它们本可以飞走呀。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3838707239",
      "Source": "Shooting hoops, just like on the playground...only there's a dodo instead of a ball. Ignore the dodo's complaints and score 50 points before the timer runs out. Hey, if the dodo doesn't like it, it should have learned to fly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"和普通投篮一样...只不过这里把篮球换成了渡渡鸟。不用搭理它们的抱怨声, 在时限内获得50分。如果渡渡鸟不喜欢被当成球, 那它们本可以飞走呀。","JA":""},
