    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4258293255",
      "Source": "Strands of Organic Polymer cause this to disperse heat and keep you cool.  Camouflage keeps you more hidden from enemy creatures.  Provides moderate physical protection, but less than Chitin.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"有机聚合物的材质可以更好的散热, 让你变得凉爽。伪装能使你更好地躲避敌对生物。它能提供适度的物理保护, 但保护效果不如甲壳。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1582602487",
      "Source": "Strider Transmitter",
      "Trans": {"SC":"泰克跨步者传送器","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1342067696",
      "Source": "Striker's Landing",
      "Trans": {"SC":"前锋平台","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3596438759",
      "Source": "Striker's Point",
      "Trans": {"SC":"前锋尖端","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2967338077",
      "Source": "Striking fear into the hearts of one's enemies may be a crucial component of survival.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"成为敌人心中的梦魇往往是你求生的关键。\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2897172287",
      "Source": "Strip of the Bold",
      "Trans": {"SC":"勇者水域","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::504663367",
      "Source": "Stripes",
      "Trans": {"SC":"条纹","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2846196287",
      "Source": "Stripes and Belly",
      "Trans": {"SC":"条纹和腹部","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2864513686",
      "Source": "Stronger than any lone creature, one may die but the pack will survive.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"单丝不成线, 独木不成林。\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1658480104",
      "Source": "Structurally, this building's basically a bunker. The walls look durable enough to withstand a few dozen megatons of force, and they're built to last. That alone told me it was important, but it was nothing compared to the sprawling, circular control center we found inside.\n\nRows of consoles cascade out from middle of the room, and the walls are lined with massive screens. While everything here's wearing a fine coat of dust, I see lights flashing and status reports flowing. This entire facility is still operational, and it's the heart of everything we've been through - the space stations we were on are all being monitored right here!\n\nGuess I know what we're here for now. Better roll up my sleeves, this is going to be a ton of data to sort through...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"从结构上来讲, 这个建筑就是一个地堡。墙壁看起来很结实, 能够承受几百万吨的力量, 而且耐久性很好。光这一点就让我知道这里很重要, 但是这还比不上我们在内部发现的那个平铺着的圆形控制中心。\n\n成排的控制器从房间的中央倾泻出来, 而墙上排列着巨大的屏幕。即使这里的所有东西都盖着厚厚的一层灰, 我还是能够看见有光在闪动, 有状态报告在滚动。\n\n整个设施都还在运作, 而且这就是我们所经历过的一切的核心——我们曾经居住的空间站都在这里被监控着!\n\n我猜我知道我们现在在哪里了。最好开始干活了, 有一大堆数据需要整理...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
