    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3917280434",
      "Source": "Success! Great job!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"成功了! 干得好!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1185303499",
      "Source": "Successfully completing particular missions can grant special effects to everyone on this ARK. Currently, none of these effects are active.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"成功完成特定的任务可以为这里的每个人赋予特殊效果。 当前, 这些效果均未激活。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4173912175",
      "Source": "Such power may be crucial when survival becomes a question of raw physical capability.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当蛮力至上成为生存法则时, 这种力量可能是众人皆求的。\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2808547566",
      "Source": "Such power! Such beauty! I can feel it within me, growing stronger by the second. Never have I felt so alive!\nIt was a risk, of course. My process is not yet perfected, but by cutting off the circulation in my left arm, I was able to contain my metamorphosis within it. Now I can study the results before I undergo my final ascension to godhood.\nI must hurry! Hurry! I cannot hide my arm from these lesser creatures for long, nor can I resist its allure. It is taking all my discipline to not simply ascend right now. Yes, why don't I? I should do it! I deserve it, I... \nNo, patience! Patience! You’ve waited so very long, just wait a little longer.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"如此强大! 如此美丽! 我能感受到它, 它在我体内一点点变强。我从没有感到过如此精力充沛!\n\n当然, 这有些冒险。我的操作流程还不完美, 但是我切断了我左臂的血液循环, 这样我就能够把我的蜕变控制在左臂上。现在我就能够研我的究试验结果了, 然后再完成我成神的最终升华。\n\n我必须加快脚步! 快一点! 我不能一直在那些低等生物面前藏着我的手臂, 而且我自己也禁不住这份诱惑。即使是现在, 我都要全力克制住我自己不立刻进行最终的升华。是的, 为什么不呢? 我应该这么做! 我配得上, 我...\n\n不, 要耐心! 耐心! 你已经等了很久了, 只需要在等一会儿。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
