    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::115075680",
      "Source": "SurvivorLootSet",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者战利品套装","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1821553446",
      "Source": "Survivors and Creatures gain experience points throughout gameplay. As you gain experience, you level up and gain stat points, which can be spent to improve your survival skills. Points can be allocated in; Health, Stamina, Oxygen, Food, Water, Weight, Melee Damage, Movement Speed, Fortitude, and Crafting Speed.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者和生物可以在游戏过程中获得经验值。当您拥有足量经验值后, 您的角色会升级并且获得属性点。这些属性点可以分配给: 生命值、耐力、氧气、食物、水、重量、近战伤害、移动速度、抗性和制作技能。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3710313803",
      "Source": "Survivors are currently in this mission. It will become available again when they complete it or when time runs out.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"目前正有生存者在执行这项任务。直到他们完成该任务或任务超时才可再次执行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1766083052",
      "Source": "Survivors, creatures, and most structures have inventories. At the top of the inventory, you will see two tabs. One tab is for your item storage, and the other tab is for crafting new items. Below the two tabs, there is a search bar for you to filter your tabs, as well as some buttons which will help you manage your inventory. At the bottom of the inventory, you will see your Quick Item Slots. You can place items in here to make them quickly accessible. Your inventory also displays your currently equipped items which you will see visible in the center.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"生存者、各种生物和绝大多数的建筑物都有物品栏。在物品栏的顶部, 您可以看到两个选项卡。一个选项卡是您自己的物品栏, 另一个是您的制造栏。在下方还有您还可以看到一个搜索栏, 配合旁边的按键, 您可以快速管理自己的物品。物品栏的下方是您的物品快捷栏。您可以直接把物品拖动到这里, 方便快速使用。另外, 中央区域显示了您当前装备的物品。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
