      "Trans": {"SC":"System Malfunction:","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::513746659",
      "Source": "System Root",
      "Trans": {"SC":"系统根目录","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1990579149",
      "Source": "Systems online and engines purring. My MEK is go for launch, so whatever did this better watch its ass. Payback's coming.\n\nI'm competent enough with TEK armor and a rifle, but if you really want to see me make magic happen, put me inside a cockpit. I might specialize in fighters, but I've aced all the simulations with just about every vehicle in the URE arsenal. It doesn't matter if it's got wheels, wings or legs, with a machine like this at my fingertips, there's no such thing as impossible.\n\nAll right, mystery voice, keep that target locked for me. Reinforcements are en route, and you'd better believe we're bringing the thunder.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"系统上线了, 引擎在轰鸣。我的MEK机甲可以启动了, 所以不管是谁弄坏了这台机甲, 它们最好小心点。它们的报应来了。\n\n我能够很好地使用泰克装甲和泰克枪, 但是如果你真的想要看我展现全部实力的话, 那就把我丢进一个驾驶舱里吧。\n\n虽然我的专精是开战斗机, 但是在URE军械库里所有载具的模拟系统中我都拿到了最高分。不管它是带轮子的, 有翅膀的还是长了腿的, 只要我能操控这类机器, 就没有什么事情是不可能的。\n\n好啦, 神秘的声音, 帮我定位好那个目标。支援正在赶来, 而且相信我, 我们将会如雷霆一般赶到。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
