    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4007049023",
      "Source": "The Beast Queen is no longer a concern. It was a simple matter, really. A small team of Legionnaires planted explosives in the Sharks' camp in the dead of night while leaving hers conspicuously untouched.\n\nPredictably, the explosions drew the Beast Queen's attention but the Sharks mistook her advance for an enemy attack. After that, it was only a matter of time before they parted ways.\n\nWith that barbarian removed from the conflict, this land war will end shortly. We've already pushed the Sharks out of Legion territory. Soon we will face them where they are strongest – the open sea.\n\nGaius Marcellus Nerva\nVictoria per Disciplinam",
      "Trans": {"SC":"兽林女王不再是一个问题, 这真的很简单。夜深人静时, 我命令一小队新军士兵潜入绘鲨部落的营地并安放了炸药, 而她的营地却明显未受影响。\n\n不出所料, 爆炸引起了兽林女王的注意, 把她和她的兽群引到了绘鲨部落的营地, 使绘鲨部落误认为是敌人来袭了。这次行动令兽林女王与绘鲨部落有了嫌隙, 在那之后, 他们分道扬镳只是时间问题。\n\n随着那个野蛮人从冲突中消失, 这场陆战将很快结束。我们已经把绘鲨部落赶出了军团的领地。很快, 我们将在他们最强大的地方——海上面对他们。\n\n盖尤斯·马塞勒斯·涅尔瓦\n\n自律致胜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::818753099",
      "Source": "The Belly of the Beast",
      "Trans": {"SC":"凶兽之腹","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3140388170",
      "Source": "The Blackthumbs are destroyed. Their leader was defiant, but his tribesmen did not wish to fight the inevitable. They offered us his head last evening. I suspect surrenders will be more frequent now. The Blackthumbs were the first, but they shall not be the last.\n\nYes, I see it clearly. This is destiny. The gods have brought me here to bring order, to save these people from their own savagery. Janus pulled me across a bridge of time and space, Mars lent me his strength and now I shall create my own empire in their name.\n\nGaius Marcellus Nerva\nVictoria per Disciplinam",
      "Trans": {"SC":"黑指部落被摧毁了。虽然他们的头领拒不投降, 但是他手下的成员不希望对抗这注定的败局。昨晚他们献上了他的首级。我怀疑从今以后投诚者会越来越多。黑指是第一个, 但肯定不是最后一个。\n\n是的, 我终于看清了。这是命运。诸神派我到这里来是为了建立秩序, 以保护这些人免于自己的野蛮行径。两面神带我跨过这座时空之桥, 战神赋予我他的力量。现在我将以他们之名, 建立属于自己的帝国。\n\n盖尤斯·马塞勒斯·涅尔瓦\n\n自律致胜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
