    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3801771222",
      "Source": "This Is It",
      "Trans": {"SC":"就是这样","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3849637308",
      "Source": "This Little Light of Mine",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这小小的光芒","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1191868531",
      "Source": "This Mountain's On Fire",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这座山着火了","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1833378714",
      "Source": "This Nerva bloke's FIGJAM incarnate. He seems to think that he's Jupiter's gift to the Island or some rubbish like that. I think his ego was actually tangible when the Legion returned from to the obelisk with the third key and the head of a dragon in tow.\n\nSadly, as much as I would enjoy seeing him fall flat on his face, I need him and I need the New Legion. So, when he \"asked\" me to guide his forces to the hidden cave, I obliged without protest.\n\nWhat he'll do with me afterwards, I don't know.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个叫涅尔瓦的家伙简直是战神的化身。他似乎认为他是神赐给岛上的礼物或是类似的垃圾想法。我认为当军团带着第三把钥匙和一条龙的头颅从方尖碑返回时, 他的自负其实是真的。\n\n遗憾的是, 尽管我很乐意看到他遭遇惨败, 但我需要他, 需要新军团。所以, 当他要求我引导他的部队到隐藏的山洞时, 我没有抗议就答应了。我不知道他之后会对我做什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1905604586",
      "Source": "This Nida claims to come from a long line of caretakers who lived out their lives tending their gardens in the sky.\n\nShe says we're under attack by some kind of invading force.\n\nI was shown visions of creatures and lands twisted out of shape in the other garden-wheel.\n\nI felt pathetic and weak, once I understood how far outside my own time and place I truly was.\n\nNida told me my trials in the netherworld that she called Genesis should have prepared me for our coming fight, but I was less sure.\n\nThen she showed me the colossal mechanical mules the caretakers use to work the land, how those can cut through solid rock with spears of light as bright as the sun.\n\nAnd I saw how we may not be as powerless as I'd feared.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"妮达声称自己是一名古老的看护者的后人, 她们世世代代都致力于照看他们的空中花园。\n\n她说我们正在遭受某种入侵的邪恶势力的攻击。\n\n她向我展示了在另一个花园圆环中的异幻的生物以及扭曲变形的大地。\n\n等我明白自己到底是有多么不适应现在这个时代和这个地方的时候, 我感到可悲和无力。\n\n妮达告诉我, 我在地狱的审判就是她所谓的被称为创世纪的虚空之地, 我在那里所经历的试炼本应该能让我为即将到来的战斗做好准备, 可我并没有太大的把握。\n\n然后她向我展示了看护者们用于打理这片土地的巨型机械骡子, 它们可以使用如太阳一般耀眼的光矛切割坚硬的岩石。\n\n然后我就意识到, 我们或许并不像我所担心的那样弱小无力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3793228944",
