    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2009173343",
      "Source": "This Tek-powered Chamber lets you rapidly recover vitals, and slowly gain XP even when sleeping. You can also sleep soundly within it, protected even while on a moving platform!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个泰克舱室可以让你快速回复生命体征并且缓慢增加经验值。即便在移动平台上使用, 它也能保护你的安全!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1933454313",
      "Source": "This adobe pillar adds structural integrity to the area it is build under.  Can also act as stilts for buildings on inclines.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"黏土加工而成的柱子, 也可以在坡地上作为建筑物的地基。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4106060869",
      "Source": "This adobe slab can be used to secure hatches.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"黏土加工而成的天窗门, 可以安放在天窗框上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1170477108",
      "Source": "This advanced aiming device places a red dot where the weapon is pointed.\nAttach this to a supporting weapon to add a laser sight.\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">Supports:  Pistols, Assault Rifle, Shotguns, Longneck Rifle, Sniper Rifle.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个先进的瞄准设备可以在武器指向之处显示一个红点。把它装到武器上来使用。\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">适用于: 手枪、制式突击步枪、泵动式霰弹枪、长管步枪和狙击步枪。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4595110",
      "Source": "This advanced explosive can annihilate structures.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种先进的爆炸物可以彻底摧毁建筑物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::622458844",
      "Source": "This advanced pistol gains a high rate of fire and a large magazine size by sacrificing stopping power.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个先进的手枪牺牲了阻滞力从而获得了更快的发射速度和更大的弹夹空间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1129325033",
      "Source": "This advanced scope can tell friends from strangers.\nAttach this to a supporting weapon to gain more accurate aiming.\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">Supports: Machine Pistol, Assault Rifle, and Machined Shotgun.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个先进的瞄准设备可以区分敌我。把它装到武器上以获得更高的准确度。\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">适用于: 制式手枪、制式突击步枪和泵动式霰弹枪。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1634893233",
      "Source": "This blue berry grows mostly in dense jungles.  Tasty, and can be used to make blue dye.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种蓝色浆果长在茂密的丛林中。味道甜美, 可以被做成蓝色染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
