      "Source": "This brew doesn't have any nutritional value, but fills your stamina.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个酿酒没有任何营养价值, 但可以恢复体力。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3304444912",
      "Source": "This brew doesn't have any nutritional value, but it promotes healing.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个酿酒没有任何营养价值, 却有助愈合伤势。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3636214183",
      "Source": "This brick-and-mortar ceiling has a hole in it for trapdoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"石头加工而成的天窗框, 用来安放天窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1869157329",
      "Source": "This bright golden seed is rarely dropped from the Embertree and is a favorite snack of the Grand Embertross.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1785919141",
      "Source": "This citrus fruit grows naturally along the coast.  It will probably prevent scurvy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这柑橘类水果自然生长在海岸沿线。它可能会预防坏血病。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::185158095",
      "Source": "This city has been empty for so long, far longer than it was full. Yet its prime was truly wondrous, short lived though it was - a city built by the hands of man under the guidance of something higher.\n\nIts towers sparkled, machines filled its streets, and its people harvested miracles from the rivers of violet that flowed beneath its skin. It was a marvel. The pinnacle of technological advancement on this planet. It is here where the System was born, and the prototype was forged around it.\n\nBut those halcyon days are gone. Now all it offers you is some small protection against the shadows that lurk outside its walls, and even that will prove fleeting.\n\nMake use of its skeleton, but do not rely on it. The shadows are seeping through its shield, and a different threat stalks within.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个城市已经闲置了好久了, 它住满人的时间都没有这么长。但是它在全盛时期真的非常惊人, 尽管这段时期很短暂——在一个更高级的存在的指导下, 由人类亲手建立起来的一座城市。\n\n它的高塔闪烁着光芒, 街道上充斥着各种机械, 而它的人民们从城市下方流淌着的紫色河流中收获奇迹。这就是一个传奇。这个星球上的科技发展到达了巅峰。这就是系统诞生的地方, 而那些原型机就是围绕着它铸造起来的。\n\n但是那些平静的日子已经过去了。现在, 面对着在城墙外游荡的暗影们, 这座城市只能给你提供一点点保护, 而且即使是这点保护也即将消失。\n\n充分利用这座城市的残骸, 但是不能依赖它。暗影正在一点点地渗过它的防护, 而且在城市内还有另一种威胁在游荡。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4013421481",
      "Source": "This composite Tek ceiling has a hole in it for trapdoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"泰克材料加工而成的天窗框, 用来安放天窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3790759414",
      "Source": "This composite Tek foundation is used to build walls around an area.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一种超级结实的栅栏地基, 可以在上面安放墙壁。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3814939420",
      "Source": "This composite Tek pillar adds structural integrity to the area it is build under.  Can also act as stilts for buildings on inclines.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"泰克材料加工而成的柱子, 也可以在坡地上作为建筑物的地基。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
