    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2109422158",
      "Source": "This creamy dish improves the body's natural constitution.  Consume it to slow your rate of oxygen consumption while underwater, and gain extra health regen.  Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道奶油菜品可增强人体机能。消耗它可以放缓在水下的耗氧率, 并获得额外的血量恢复。效果持续15分钟","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::240956716",
      "Source": "This creamy dish improves the body's natural constitution.  You will recover from injury more quickly after eating this, and your body will need less oxygen.\n\n3 servings of cooked meat\n5 Savoroot\n5 Longrass\n1 handful of Mejoberries\n1/2 dollop of Narcotic\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道奶油菜品可增强人体机能。吃了它获得额外的生命值恢复,可以放缓在水下的耗氧率。\n\n3份熟肉\n5个土豆\n5个玉米\n1把紫色浆果\n1/2勺麻醉药\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2443566369",
      "Source": "This crystal has been polished naturally and is extra tastey to the Crystal Wyverns.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"This crystal has been polished naturally and is extra tastey to the Crystal Wyverns.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::234949636",
      "Source": "This crystal has been refined over time and can make a great treat for the crystal wyverns",
      "Trans": {"SC":"This crystal has been refined over time and can make a great treat for the crystal wyverns","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3560545675",
      "Source": "This crystal is pure and one of the best treats to feed a crystal wyvern.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"This crystal is pure and one of the best treats to feed a crystal wyvern.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3677937332",
      "Source": "This crystal makes for a tasty treat to the Crystal Wyverns.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"This crystal makes for a tasty treat to the Crystal Wyverns.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1306532158",
      "Source": "This device uses radio waves to detonate all primed C4 packages on the same frequency.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该装置使用无线电波引爆所有设置在相同频率上的C4炸药。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1552850145",
      "Source": "This dish grants you a hunters instinct.  Consume it to ignore most weather, and steady your aim. Effects last 3 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道菜品可以让你拥有猎人的本能。吃了它可以无视大多数天气并提高准确度。效果持续3分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::622508210",
      "Source": "This dish grants you almost combat prowess of a berserker.  Consume it to gain massively increased melee damage, move speed, damage resistance, and stamina regen.  Also causes you to consume food and water more quickly, and lose health.  Effects last 3 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该菜品甚至可以让你和勇猛的狂暴战士作战。吃了它增加大量近战伤害、移动速度、伤害抗性和耐力回复。但也会使你更快地消耗食物和水。效果持续3分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3210786522",
      "Source": "This doesn't end well...\n\nJust before death, you will be teleported out of the simulation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个结局真糟糕...\n\n临死前, 你将被传送出模拟系统。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2444870823",
      "Source": "This fairly common black berry makes you sleepy when you eat it.  Bitter, but can be used to make black dye.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"当你吃它时这相当常见的黑色浆果会使你昏昏欲睡。虽然苦, 但可用来做黑色染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2320026665",
      "Source": "This fairly common white berry can be eaten in a pinch to recover Food, Stamina, and lose Torpidity, but it will dehydrate you.  Bitter, but can be used to make white dye.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种相当常见的白色浆果吃一点点可以增加食物, 耐力和消除眩晕, 但会使你脱水。虽然味苦, 但可用来做白色染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3116697755",
      "Source": "This filling dish is full of nutritional energy.  Consume it to gain increased craft speed, and gain increased movement speed.  Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道菜充满营养能量。吃了它以增加制作速度和移动速度。效果持续15分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2468038432",
      "Source": "This filling dish is full of nutritional energy.  You will notice your mind more focussed after eating this, allowing you to avoid obstacles and distractions.\n\n3 servings of cooked meat\n5 Citronal\n2 handfuls of Amarberries\n2 handfuls of Azulberries\n2 handfuls of Tintoberries\n1 handful of Mejoberries\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道菜充满营养能量。吃了它你会注意到你的思想更集中, 让你避免障碍和干扰。\n\n3份熟肉\n5个柠檬\n2把黄色浆果\n2把蓝色浆果\n2把红色浆果\n1把紫色浆果\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2575067527",
      "Source": "This firm, flexible material makes up exoskeletons. Hacked primarily from dead insects.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种坚固柔软的材料构成了外骨骼。主要从死掉的昆虫身上得来。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
