      "Source": "This flag is proof that you have defeated the VR Boss.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这面旗帜证明了你曾经打败了主宰者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::457939538",
      "Source": "This flashlight sheds light out in a wide area, but makes you easier to see too.\nAttach this to a supporting weapon to shine light from a weapon.\n<RichColor Color=\"0,1,1,1\">Supports: Sniper Rifle, Pistols, Longneck Rifle, Shotguns, and Assault Rifle.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个手电筒可照亮一大片空间, 让你更容易看清黑暗中的东西。把它装到武器上来使用。\n<RichColor Color=\"0, 1, 1, 1\">适用于: 手枪、制式突击步枪、泵动式霰弹枪、长管步枪和狙击步枪。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2442375564",
      "Source": "This giant metal-plated concrete ceiling has a hole in it for trapdoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金属混凝土加工而成的巨型天窗框, 用来安放天窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4108253553",
      "Source": "This gnarly paste makes you nearly invisible to bugs, bats, and spiders. Just don't attack them or get too close, and they'll ignore you! Effect lasts 10 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"涂抹这种粗糙药膏后可使蝙蝠和蜘蛛看不到你。只要不攻击他们或靠的太近, 他们不会注意到你! 效果持续10分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::286847267",
      "Source": "This grain plant grows best in open, fertile areas.  It can be eaten by the cob, but more clever chefs will think of other options.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种粮食作物在开放, 肥沃的地区生长得最好。虽然它结的玉米可以直接食用, 但聪明的厨师会考虑用在其他地方。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::330681521",
      "Source": "This hearty dish is like a workout in the form of a meal.  Consume it to deal increased melee damage, and gain extra stamina regen.  Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这顿丰盛的菜肴就像是一种赏赐。吃了它来增加近战伤害, 并获得额外的耐力回复。效果持续15分钟。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2743559321",
      "Source": "This hearty dish is like a workout in the form of a meal.  You will find yourself hitting harder and running longer after eating this.\n\n3 servings of cooked meat\n5 Rockarrot\n5 Savoroot\n1 handful of Mejoberries\n1/2 dollop of Stimulant\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这顿丰盛的菜肴就像是一种赏赐。吃了它增加近战伤害, 而且跑得更远了。\n\n3份熟肉\n5个胡萝卜\n5个土豆\n1把紫色浆果\n1/2勺兴奋剂\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3507782809",
      "Source": "This hide sleeping bag acts as a single-use respawn point, only usable by you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个兽皮睡袋作为一次性使用的复活点, 只有你能使用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2421985269",
      "Source": "This instrument, while primitive, is effective at short-range analysis of both flora and fauna.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个工具虽然原始, 但是可以有效地近距离分析动植物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::482355737",
      "Source": "This instrument, while primitive, is quite effective at long-range reconnaissance.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个工具虽然原始, 但是可以有效远程侦察。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::133194738",
      "Source": "This is a generic weapon.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是个通用武器。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2712748961",
      "Source": "This is a place of death. The ground is scarred and barren, and there is no light or movement save that of the violet fire. Even Ao Yue does not seem to like it. The living should not tread here.\nWhy would Juzi come here? What was so important that she would risk this place, and why would she not tell me? Whatever the reason, it has already cost some of her teammates their lives. I found their bodies earlier today, mangled and partially devoured beside the remains of their beasts. Thankfully Juzi was not among them.\nGreat towers of crystal loom ahead, where the violet fire has frozen solid. Perhaps she has found shelter there.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此乃一荒地也。除紫火外, 无光无影, 虽敖越亦不好此地。\n\n何故桔子至此? 何物如此重要以致桔冒险至此, 却不告吾? 无论何也, 其友已为此丧命。今晨, 吾见其尸骨, 为怪所蹂躏分食。幸哉, 桔子非其中。\n\n水晶柱前, 紫火凝矣。桔子或寻一所也。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1169217683",
      "Source": "This is a very long item description that is almost certain to wrap onto multiple lines of text.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一个非常长的项目描述, 几乎可以肯定能包到多行文本","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1293649996",
      "Source": "This is all thanks to you. I'm just glad I got to see it.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这些都归功于你。我很高兴自己能亲眼目睹这一场景。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2864444972",
      "Source": "This is an all or nothing gamble. If we can't repair the two MEKs that got left behind the last time this King of the Titans came out to play, then we're just going to die where everyone else did.\n\nBut if we can get them up and running somehow, then we can fuse all four of them and form Santiago's super weapon! With the damage these MEKs have sustained and only two pilots, it won't be at full capacity, but lucky for us I'm the top ace in the whole damn URE. As long the engine's running and the guns are loaded, I can give us a chance.\n\nOkay, break's over. From here on, we're heading towards that battlefield at full burn.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是一场孤注一掷的赌博。如果我们不能修好那两架在上次泰坦之王出来遛弯时被弄坏的MEK机甲的话, 那么我们就只能和其他人一样死翘翘了。\n\n但是如果我们能够设法修好它们并让它们运作起来的话, 那么我们就能够让它们合体并组装成圣地亚哥的超级武器!\n\n虽然这些MEK都有些损坏, 而且我们只有两个驾驶员, 导致它并不能发挥出全力, 但是我们很走运, 我是整个该死的URE中最优秀的驾驶员。只要引擎还在运转, 枪里面还有子弹, 我就能够给我们一线生机。\n\n好啦, 休息时间结束了。从现在开始, 我们要全速赶往那个战场。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1950374013",
      "Source": "This is gonna be hard!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这将会很困难!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1875340651",
      "Source": "This is my failure. At first we forced the enemy back, so when their master finally set foot on the battlefield, I tried to slay him myself. That was our undoing. Even in my armored giant, I couldn't even scratch his hide. Such disgusting weakness.\n\nWere it not for my second blunder, surely I would have died, but Helena had stolen the sunlit gem from me before the battle. Before the demon could crush me, she opened the shell of her giant, held the gem aloft, and placed it in the metal mark upon her wrist.\n\nA terrible scream rang out in my mind, but it must have been worse for the monsters. They recoiled in confusion, and I knew that would be our only chance. All but Helena and I lay dead or dying, and Helena herself lacked the strength to stand. So I cradled her in my giant's hands, and ran.\n\nIn shame and defeat, I ran.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"此吾之败也 交战伊始 敌军败退 敌首现身之时吾正欲手刃 此余所不该为也 敌首身战甲胄巨人而无毫厘之伤 甚为恼人\n\n若非吾再犯之错 吾当已身首异处 然战前海莲娜窃而夺宝石 妖魔正欲灭吾之时 海莲娜手开甲胄巨人护甲 高举宝石于上 置于其手臂金属环处\n\n余闻尖叫声 怪兽甚为不堪 卷曲混乱 余识此唯一良机也 战罢 海莲娜与吾除外 皆丧命 海莲娜无力撑足 余抱其至巨人掌中 退离\n\n战败耻辱 伴吾夺路而逃","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::43534779",
      "Source": "This is the perfect tree to use when celebrating the winter solstace!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这棵堪称完美的圣诞树是庆祝冬至的最佳选择!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1345893030",
      "Source": "This is the smoking gun. It has to be. I simply can't be convinced that this place is natural after finding an island populated entirely by carnivores. \n\nEven if they fed off of each other – which is awfully dubious given that carnivore meat is much more likely to carry harmful parasites than herbivore meat – the landmass is so small and their population is so dense that they could never maintain it. Yet there it is, hidden away off the northeast coast of the Island. Someone would have to put them there on purpose.\n\nThere's no way that Rockwell can deny my theory now.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"确凿无误! 就是它了。我简直无法相信会存在一个完全由食肉动物构成的小岛。\n\n就算它们相互捕食——这点也非常可疑, 因为食肉动物比食草动物更可能携带有害寄生虫——这么小的陆地面积不可能维持如此高密度的生物。但它确实存在着, 小岛位于孤岛的东北方。肯定是有人故意设置的。\n\n这下罗克韦尔没法否定我的理论了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3027257143",
      "Source": "This is your chance to stop him",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是你阻止他的机会","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::124297037",
      "Source": "This magical soup will greatly reduce your water consumption. The aroma of the cactus has a side effect of making the wildlife notice you less.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这碗神奇的菜汤会大幅度减少你的水分消耗量。同时仙人掌的气味也会让野生动物不容易注意到你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1577528516",
      "Source": "This metal tap allows access to the water in an irrigation network.  Can refill containers, irrigate crop plots, or provide a refreshing drink.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金属水龙头, 供水网络的出水口。当供水网络中有水时, 可以在水龙头处直接饮用水, 也可以在水龙头中为水袋\\水瓶\\水壶装水。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3468759035",
      "Source": "This metal-plated concrete ceiling has a hole in it for trapdoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金属混凝土加工而成的天窗框, 用来安放天窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3771134727",
      "Source": "This metal-plated concrete pillar adds structural integrity to the area it is build under.  Can also act as stilts for buildings on inclines.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金属混凝土加工而成的柱子, 也可以在坡地上作为建筑物的地基。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2019854160",
      "Source": "This metal-plated concrete slab can be used to secure hatches.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"金属混凝土加工而成的天窗门, 可以安放在天窗框上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2502254777",
      "Source": "This miiight feel a bit weird.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这可能感觉有些诡异。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2271409851",
      "Source": "This mission is currently available.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"该任务当前可进行。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2241983728",
      "Source": "This modern bunk-style bed has two mattresses, and a high thread count.  Acts as a respawn point for you and your tribe with half cooldown time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种现代的双层床上有2个床垫, 用料考究。作为你和你部落的复活点可以减少一半的冷却时间。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1907647651",
      "Source": "This morning I spotted Yongki walking through headquarters, looking pale as a ghost.\n\n I could see he wasn't just hung over.\n\nI knew the look because I'd been there myself, just recently.\n\nHe was wandering in the direction of the archive until I steered him into my office instead.\n\nYongki looked past me, muttering about how he'd just quit.\n\nI hugged him to show I understood.\n\nThen he whispered something for my ears only, something I knew I wouldn't forget as long as I lived.\n\nWhich it turned out was only about half a second longer-as long as it took for his vest to blast us into superheated plasma.\n\nBut now all those chunks of us are reversing direction and reintegrating, so Uma can lean in and try to hear Yongki's last words.\n\nAnd now we're flying apart again, passing through her like she isn't there, because of course she wasn't in my office when this actually happened.\n\nI stopped existing at the point of that explosion-or really, really soon afterwards.\n\nI'm just an emulation of the late Santiago 2.0 now, that Uma's running in her damned Genesis engine.\n\nSucks to be me, huh?",
      "Trans": {"SC":"今天早上我看到永吉穿过了总部, 他看起来就像一个苍白的鬼魂。\n\n我能看出来这不仅仅是因为宿醉。\n\n我能明白他为什么会这幅样子是因为我也经历过这样的事情, 就在最近。\n\n他当时正朝着档案库的方向走去, 而我转而把他拉进了我的办公室。\n\n永吉没有看我, 他咕哝着要退出。\n\n我拥抱了他, 以此表示我能理解。\n\n然后他轻声说了一些只有我能听见的东西, 而我知道只要我还活着, 我就永远忘不了他所说的话。\n\n而我后来只活了大概半秒钟——他的背心很快就把我们两个都炸成了过热的等离子体\n\n但是现在我们两人的碎片改变了方向又重新聚集到了一起, 这样尤玛就可以凑过来试图倾听永吉的临终遗言。\n\n然后现在我们两个又飞散开来了, 碎片穿透了她的身体, 就好像她根本不在那里一样, 因为爆炸发生的时候她确实没有在我的办公室里。\n\n在爆炸发生的那一刻我就不存在了——或是说在那之后很快就不存在了。\n\n我现在只不过是尤玛在她那该死的创世引擎中运行的一个已故的圣地亚哥2.0的模拟程序。\n\n我的人生真是糟透了, 对吧?","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::385940683",
      "Source": "This multipurpose computer chip can be used to create electronic devices.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种多用途的计算机芯片可用于制造电子设备。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::455470980",
      "Source": "This mushroom can be found pretty much everywhere. It's tasty, and heals you slowly over time. Great in recipes!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种棕色蘑菇随处可见。又好吃又有治疗功效。还可入菜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::604349276",
      "Source": "This must seem suspicious. My existence, I mean. I have you at a disadvantage, I admit. I'm operating from a position of near perfect information, while you are...not. To put it mildly. Not that you're unintelligent! Clearly you're very clever, to find so many different uses for thatch. \n\nI digress again. The point is: you have no reason to trust me. Most everything you've met has tried to kill you, so from your perspective, it follows that I would do the same. You humans do love your patterns.\nI can't force you to believe me. In fact, I can't compel anyone to do anything. Even when it comes to digital systems, my control is limited. I merely pass on suggestions, not commandments.\n\nSo all I can do is ask you to believe in me, as I have believed in all of you.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这一定看起来很可疑。我是说, 我的存在。我承认我有置你于不利的地位。我利用着几乎完美的情报系统操控着一切, 而你...老实说, 没有这个优势。我不是说你傻! 很明显, 你非常聪明, 能够发现茅草的那么多不同的用途。\n\n我又跑题了。关键是: 你没有理由相信我。你所遇到的几乎所有东西都曾试图要你的命, 所以从你的角度来看, 我也当然会这么做。你们人类就是喜欢模式思维。\n\n我不能强迫你相信我。事实上, 我无法强迫任何人做任何事。即使是在数据系统中, 我的权限也是有限的。我只能给出建议, 而不能下达命令。\n\n所以我所能做的就是请求你相信我, 就如我相信你们所有人一样。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3865149084",
      "Source": "This ore is simply extraordinary! It is warm to the touch, even during these cold desert nights, and it pulses as though it has its own heartbeat. It is at once light and more sturdy than any natural material I have encountered. The uses one could find for such a substance…\n\nI shall have to name it at some point. What would do? Rockwellium? Edmunium?\n\nA dilemma for another time. For now I have more pressing matters. Timur and his Burning Phoenix savages have played their part, and I cannot remain in their custody. It is time for the great warrior chief to receive his just reward.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这矿石实在是非比寻常! 即使在寒冷的沙漠之夜, 它摸上去也是温暖的, 而且还会像有心跳一样震动。它既轻盈又比我见过的任何天然材质都更坚固。这样的材质潜在的用途真是...\n\n我得给它起个名字。叫什么好呢? 罗克韦尔之石? 艾德蒙金属? \n\n以后再纠结吧。目前我有更紧迫的事宜。帖木儿和他的浴火凤凰野人们已经发挥了应有的作用, 而我也不能继续与他们为伍了。是时候让这伟大的战士首领获得他应有的奖励了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4111346820",
      "Source": "This pet food recipe has been carefully designed to give balanced nutrition to almost any creature native to the island.  Includes plant fibers to help with digestion and egg to bind the mix.  Humans have difficulty digesting this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个精心设计的宠物食品配方是为了给这个岛上几乎所有的生物提供均衡的营养, 包括有助于消化的植物纤维, 并混合有蛋类等物质。人类很难消化这个","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1190387558",
      "Source": "This pet food recipe has been carefully designed to give balanced nutrition to almost any creature native to the island.  Includes the best protein, plant fibers to help with digestion, and egg to bind the mix.  Humans have difficulty digesting this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个精心设计的宠物食品配方是为了给这个岛上几乎所有的生物提供均衡的营养, 其中包含了最优质的蛋白质, 有助于消化的植物纤维, 并混合有蛋类等物质。人类很难消化这个","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2913855690",
      "Source": "This pet food recipe has been carefully designed to give balanced nutrition to many small creatures.  Includes plant fibers to help with digestion and egg to bind the mix.  Humans have difficulty digesting this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这份精心设计的宠物食谱可以给许多小型生物提供均衡的营养, 其中包含有助消化的植物纤维和蛋类。不适合人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::880903339",
      "Source": "This pet food recipe has been carefully designed to give balanced nutrition to many smaller creatures.  Includes plant fibers to help with digestion and egg to bind the mix.  Humans have difficulty digesting this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这份精心设计的宠物食谱可以给许多微型生物提供均衡的营养, 其中包含有助消化的植物纤维和蛋类。不适合人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2668480164",
      "Source": "This place is even more gigantic and foreboding up close. If the architects were trying to instill an impending sense of dread in their visitors, then well done, they absolutely nailed it. Really, I campaigned for us to come here and now even I'm wary about going inside. That's a bit embarrassing, isn't it?\n\nWell no sense in putting it off. The entrance is too small for the mechs, which means we could be in for days of exploring it on foot. Of course, we could cover more ground if we split up, but given the building's aesthetic and my rudimentary knowledge of horror films, I've expressly advised against it.\n\nAll right, here we go. Let's see what we can find.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"靠近一点看, 这个地方甚至更加巨大而且不祥。如果设计师是想要给访客们灌输一种不断迫近的恐惧感的话, 那么他们很成功。\n\n真的, 当初是我发动大家来到这里的, 而现在就算是我也对进入这栋建筑深感不安。有点尴尬, 不是吗? \n\n嗯, 没理由拖延了。入口处对机甲来说太小了, 这就意味着我们有可能要花上好几天徒步探索其内部。\n\n当然, 如果我们分头行动的话, 效率会更高。但是考虑到这栋楼的美学风格以及我对恐怖电影的简单了解, 我明确地反对了分头行动。\n\n好了, 出发吧。看看我们能发现什么。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1282609188",
      "Source": "This recipe needs to be tweaked on a per-egg basis, but this will make a balanced pet food that can be eaten by any tamed creature.  A long cooking time removes excess water, which means this will last a long time on the shelf.  You will need to test the egg-meat-vegetable combinations.\n\n1 egg\n1 cooked-or-jerkied meat\n1 vegetable\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"虽然这个配方基于不同蛋类需作不同的调整, 但这是一个完美的训宠食品, 可以由任何驯养的动物吃掉。长时间的烧煮会去除多余的水分, 这意味着保质期也很久。你将需要测试的蛋肉蔬菜组合。\n\n1个蛋\n1块熟肉或肉干\n1个蔬菜\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维(有助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::377189680",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which Diplocaulus have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Archaeopteryx Egg\n1 Cooked Fish Meat Jerky\n1 Longgrass\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受盗首螈的喜爱。\n\n1颗始祖鸟蛋\n1份熟鱼肉\n1个玉米\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2744882844",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which Giant Queen Bees have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Ichthyornis Egg\n1 Rare Flower\n1 Savoroot\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受巨型女王蜂的喜爱。\n\n1颗鱼鸟蛋\n1朵稀有花朵\n1个土豆\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::326536240",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which Megalania have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Baryonyx Egg\n1 Raw Mutton\n1 Savoroot\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受古巨蜥的喜爱。\n\n1颗重爪龙蛋\n1份生羊肉\n1个土豆\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
