    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3574044864",
      "Source": "This red berry grows mostly in wide open grasslands.  Tasty, and can be used to make red dye.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种红色浆果主要长在野外开放的草地上。味道甜美, 可以被用做红色染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3753766435",
      "Source": "This roasty little seed is a rare find from the Emberflower of Emberfall.  Should you find a few try feeding them to a Grand Embertross.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"This roasty little seed is a rare find from the 烬芯花 of Emberfall.  Should you find a few try feeding them to a Grand Embertross.","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2754553310",
      "Source": "This root vegetable seems to thrive near mammals, and not dinosaurs.  As such, it can be found mostly in the mountains.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种根茎类蔬菜似乎常出现在哺乳动物而不是恐龙附近。此外它主要生长在山上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3330220749",
      "Source": "This semi-automatic rifle has less punch than a Longneck Rifle, but can be fired much more rapidly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种半自动步枪比长管步枪冲击力小, 但可以快速发射。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::919333409",
      "Source": "This simple revolver trades accuracy for flexibility.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这把简易的左轮手枪方便灵活但是准确度低。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3412552253",
      "Source": "This simple single-shot rifle is highly accurate, but has a long reload time.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这把简易的单发步枪准确度很高, 但是装填时间很长。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1629533815",
      "Source": "This simple stone contraption can be used to grind resources into new substances.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个简单的装置可以用来研磨资源转化为新的材料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::911226587",
      "Source": "This simple tonic immediately jump-starts your body's natural healing.\n\n2 handful of Tintoberries\n1/2 dollops of Narcotic\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个简单的补药立刻开始让你的身体自然愈合起来。\n\n2把红色浆果\n1/2勺麻醉药\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::910257720",
      "Source": "This simple tonic quickly rejuvenates your body's natural energy stores.\n\n2 handful of Azulberries\n1/2 dollops of Stimulant\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个简单的补药可以滋补你身体中蕴含的自然能量。\n\n2把蓝色浆果\n1/2勺兴奋剂\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3664227341",
      "Source": "This simple vegetarian dish refreshes your body like an oasis.  Consume it to gain increased hyperthermic insulation, and slow your rate of water consumption.  Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个简单的素菜像甘露一下刷新你的身体。吃了它可以增加高温抗性, 并减缓你的耗水率。效果持续15分钟","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4006361889",
      "Source": "This simple vegetarian dish refreshes your body like an oasis.  Helps keep you stay hydrated and feel cool.\n\n5 Citronal\n2 handfuls of Tintoberries\n2 handfuls of Amarberries\n1 handful of Mejoberries\n1/2 dollop of Stimulant\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道简单的素菜让你有一种久旱逢甘霖的感觉。吃了它可以增加高温抗性, 并减缓你的耗水率。\n\n5个柠檬\n2把紫色浆果\n2把黄色浆果\n1把红色浆果\n1/2勺兴奋剂\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3508582592",
      "Source": "This small reinforced door can be used to secure hatches.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的加固天窗门, 可以安放在天窗框上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::623942619",
      "Source": "This small wooden door can be used to secure hatches.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的天窗门, 可以安放在天窗框上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2362231922",
      "Source": "This specially blended pet food is a favorite of many exotic creatures. Containing only the finest natural ingredients, it provides pets with the balanced nutrition they need. And with a taste they can't resist, they'll warm up to you in no time! Not intended for human consumption.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种特制的混合型宠物食品是许多异域生物的最爱。仅选用最好的纯天然食材, 可以给宠物提供它们所需的均衡营养。而且它绝佳的口味会让恐龙吃完就深深地爱上你! 不适合人类食用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::420373848",
      "Source": "This specially blended pet food is a favorite of many extra large creatures. Containing only the finest natural ingredients, it provides pets with the balanced nutrition they need. And with a taste they can't resist, they'll warm up to you in no time! Not intended for human consumption.",
