    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::263996416",
      "Source": "This spicy vegetarian dish fills the body with a comfortable warmth.  Consume it to gain increased hypothermic insulation, and slow your rate of food consumption.  Effects last 15 minutes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个辛辣素菜给你身体一种舒适的感觉。吃掉它可以获得低温抗性, 并减缓你的食物消耗率。效果持续15分钟","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2398979750",
      "Source": "This spicy vegetarian dish fills the body with a comfortable warmth.  It controls your apetite while helping you ignore the cold.\n\n5 Longrass\n5 Rockarrot\n2 handfuls of Azulberries\n1 handful of Mejoberries\n1/2 dollop of Narcotic\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a Cooking Pot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这道辛辣素菜给你身体一种舒适的感觉。吃掉它可以获得低温抗性, 并减缓你的食物消耗率。\n\n5个玉米\n5个胡萝卜\n2把蓝色浆果\n1把紫色浆果\n1/2勺麻醉药\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1178696916",
      "Source": "This starchy tuber grows naturally in densely wooded areas.  It is very hearty, but tastes better when cooked.",
