      "Source": "This will override all other skins, acting as a full-body costume. Should always be set on Torso Armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个全身皮肤来覆盖所有其他皮肤的效果, 应该把它放在躯干位的胸甲上。","JA":""},
