    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1420709903",
      "Source": "This will override all other skins, acting as a full-body costume. Should always be set on Torso Armor.\n\nBecome the prehistoric life of the beach party!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个全身皮肤来覆盖所有其他皮肤的效果, 应该把它放在躯干位的胸甲上。在海滩派对上成为史前生物。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2620417174",
      "Source": "This will override all other skins, acting as a full-body costume. Show the world you are serious about cracking down on bad eggs.\n\nShould always be set on Torso Armor. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个全身皮肤来覆盖所有其他皮肤的效果, 应该把它放在躯干位的胸甲上。向全世界表明你对打击坏蛋是认真的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::199712055",
      "Source": "This will override your shirt, pants, glove, and boot skins, acting as a full-body costume to dress you as a jolly old elf. \n\n(You're on your own for a hat and/or beard). Should always be set on Torso Armor.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用这个皮肤来覆盖上衣、裤子、手套和靴子上的皮肤的效果(帽子或胡须由你自己决定), 让你打扮成一个快乐的老精灵。应该把它放在躯干位的胸甲上。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3886941160",
      "Source": "This woman, Mei-Yin... she's not like anyone I've ever met, and not just because she's from hundreds of years in the past. It's those eyes, they're just so intense. It's like staring into a storm.\n\nShe caused a real stir when we first brought her back to base with her pet monster, but everyone's used to her by now. Honestly I think she trusts us way less than we trust her. She only seems to speak when she's doing chores, and she's always got one hand on that sword of hers.\n\nI guess that's what it takes to survive all alone like that, but hopefully she'll learn that it's okay to let her guard down. Maybe then I can really meet the person behind those eyes.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这个叫做美盈的女人...她和我遇到过的任何人都不一样, 而且并不仅仅因为她是几百年之前的人。是她的那双灼热的眼睛。就像是风暴一样。\n\n当我们第一次把她和她的宠物带回营地的时候, 营地里炸开了锅, 但现在大家都习惯她了。老实说我觉得她信任我们的程度远比我们信任她的程度低。她似乎只在做杂务的时候才会说话, 而且一只手总是放在她的剑上。\n\n我觉得独自一个人生存是会变成那样, 但是我希望她能明白卸下戒备也不是不可以。或许那样我就能见到那双眼睛背后的真身了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1745412345",
      "Source": "This wooden ceiling has a hole in it for trapdoors.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"木头加工而成的天窗框, 用来安放天窗门。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3019965888",
      "Source": "This yellow berry grows mostly on the beaches.  Tasty, and can be used to make yellow dye.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种黄色浆果主要长在海滩上。味道甜美, 可以被做成黄色染料。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::718374224",
      "Source": "Tho Wo Ma",
      "Trans": {"SC":"Tho Wo Ma","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3543381992",
      "Source": "Thornmail Poisoned",
      "Trans": {"SC":"荆棘反伤","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3266424979",
      "Source": "Thorny Dragon Vagabond Saddle",
      "Trans": {"SC":"棘蜥流浪者鞍","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2606807520",
      "Source": "Those beasts that attacked me are mine. I retraced my steps to make sure that I found the same pack, and then I bent them to my will.\n\nThey moved as though they could walk on air, leaping from one invisible stepping stone to another before pouncing at me. It made their movements hard to predict, but once I was able to snare them in a steel trap, their advantage was gone. Though they flung arrows of ice at me from afar, it was not enough to deter me.\n\nOnce asleep, I coaxed them into obedience, and they accepted me as the leader of their pack. Their strength will help me on my journey, but I will need more still. This is just the beginning.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"袭吾之猛兽乃吾囊中之物也 折返追迹 寻觅同兽群 誓令其屈服\n\n如御风搬迁移  从一隐身之石跃至其二 猛扑袭来 其移动不可预测也 然借陷阱之力 吾得以夺其优势 纵冰箭袭来 亦不能阻\n\n入寝之时 余驯其兽性 成其兽首 旅途漫漫 必成余助力也 但求多伴 随吾开疆拓土","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2205586657",
      "Source": "Though I've been received by the Iron Brotherhood, they didn't seem very pleased to see me, especially when I mentioned Rockwell. That's a first. Add that to the rather deserted, gloomy state of their compound, and I'm starting to feel a bit apprehensive. Their leader can't return from his hunting expedition soon enough.\n\nAll I've confirmed so far is that yes, they gathered all of the artifacts Rockwell sought and yes, the artifacts were able to activate one of the obelisks. You'd think they'd be celebrating such a monumental discovery, but it's just killjoys as far as the eye can see. Go figure.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"虽然钢铁兄弟会接见了我, 但是他们似乎不欢迎我, 尤其是当我提到罗克韦尔的时候。这可是头一回发生这样的事情。另外他们营地又偏又暗, 我开始担忧起来。他们的头领出门打猎了, 一时半会儿还回不来。\n\n目前我能确认的是: 他们收集到了所有罗克韦尔在寻找的上古神器, 这些神器可以激活其中一个方尖碑。你以为他们肯定会庆祝这样值得纪念的伟大发现, 但是放眼望去只有扫兴。想想看吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3613509218",
      "Source": "Though our number was once five, only two of us have ever mattered. Only Imamu and I posses the strength of will and presence of mind to discover this place's secrets. If he can discard his inner weakness, perhaps we may find it together. If he cannot, then in the end it will come to blood.\n\nThe more he wastes his time comforting that brainless mule, Trent, the more I fear it will be the latter. A shame, but I will do what I must. The deeper we delve, the stronger I hear the call, and I am destined to answer it. This labyrinth is mine to conquer, of nothing else have I been so certain.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"虽然我们之前有五个人, 但其中只有两个人很重要。只有伊玛目和我拥有意志力, 也想揭示这个地方的秘密。如果他可以丢弃他内在的弱点, 或许我们就能并肩同行。如果他不能, 最后将会以暴力收场。\n\n他越是浪费时间在安慰那愚蠢的特伦特, 我越觉得会是后者。虽然很可惜, 但我会做我必须要做的事。我们越是往深处走, 我越能感受到那种呼唤, 命中注定我要找到它。我确信这座迷宫将由我来征服。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2358901088",
      "Source": "Thought I'd leave a little something behind for posterity's sake, for anyone following behind us. Listen-this ARK you’re on is poisoned.\n\nThe whole system's breaking down. You're going to need to do whatever you can to get yourself down to the surface. And look us up when you get there, okay?\n\nNow let's just hope this crazy plan of ours works...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我想应该为我们的后人留下点什么东西, 为了那些跟随着我们脚步的人。听着——你所在的这个方舟被污染了。\n\n整个系统都在崩溃。你需要尽你所能地返回地球。等你到了那里, 过来找我们, 好吗? \n\n现在希望我们这个疯狂的计划能够成功吧...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4002962056",
      "Source": "Three days ago, I was asked to help the villagers  obtain a clutch of dragon eggs. Only then did it occur to me that they did not have many creatures at their command. They relied far more on their tools. Perhaps this is why they were so impressed with Ao Yue.\nThe hunt went well. I had to do much of the work and explain many things, but the others were grateful. It also let me test the limits of my armor. By now, using it is no different to me than wielding a sword, and I welcomed the challenge.\nAfter the hunt, no one treats me like a child anymore, even when their tools confuse me. I suppose we all have different things that we excel at.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"三日前, 村人请吾驯龙。惟其时, 吾方悟其驯兽甚少也。村人多赖其器, 此敖越于彼, 非凡也。\n\n驯兽之旅, 吾劳其筋骨。村人感之。其亦请吾试其甲之极, 至此, 吾用甲与刀, 已无异也。吾亦易迎战。\n\n驯后, 虽吾仍惑之器。无人待吾若子也。此乃吾之擅者与异也, 而已也。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::647572766",
      "Source": "Throw it to create an oil slick which can be lit on fire! This sticky substance can also slow down people which step in it!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"扔出去形成一摊可燃的油浆! 这种粘稠的物质还能使踩到它的人减速!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2564802759",
      "Source": "Throw to deploy captured creature.\nCan be recharged in Cryofridge.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"投掷以释放被收进低温舱的生物。\n可以在低温冰箱中充电","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
