    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2861755698",
      "Source": "Tracks",
      "Trans": {"SC":"踪迹","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::863587471",
      "Source": "Training available in {0}",
      "Trans": {"SC":"训练可用于 {0}","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1720536926",
      "Source": "Training grew easier once my charges began to see the results. In fact, they've found such a wellspring of enthusiasm that their drills and chores alone cannot contain it. This morning, I found a flag flying above the armory. It was the symbol of the Imperial Legion, but with one of the island's flying lizards replacing the eagle and words in a foreign language replacing SPQR. I’m told they say \"The New Legion.\" I admit, I smiled at the sight.\n\nVery well then. It's time to find out if I've created true Legionnaires. We march at dawn.\n\nGaius Marcellus Nerva\nVictoria per Disciplinam",
      "Trans": {"SC":"我的责令渐出成效, 训练也越来越容易。日常的演练和杂务已经满足不了他们的热情。今天早上, 我在军械库上面看到一面迎风飘扬的旗帜。\n\n上面画着象征帝国军团的符号, 原来的老鹰被替换成了岛上一种会飞的蜥蜴, “元老院与罗马人民”被改成了一句外国话。他们告诉我意思是“新军”。我得承认, 我一看到就露出了微笑。\n\n非常好。是时候检验一下我是否组建了一只真正的军团。我们黎明就出发。\n\n盖尤斯·马塞勒斯·涅尔瓦\n\n自律致胜","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
