    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1161758134",
      "Source": "Trent, my friend, your sacrifice was not in vain. At long last, I have found the third artifact we sought. It took many failed expeditions, but to get lost is to learn the way. For every wrong turn, I mapped out a new part of these caverns, and now I know them as well as I know myself.\n\nI will gather my creatures and head for the terminal in the morning. If Boris' notes were right, these artifacts should be able to activate it. I'm not sure what will happen after that, but it can't be worse than the fate that awaits me here.\n\nIf only the others were alive to see this day. If only I'd been able to save them too...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"特仑特, 我的朋友, 你的牺牲不会白费。我终于发现了我们苦苦搜寻的第三件神器。虽然失败了很多次, 但正所谓迷过路才能认识路。每一条死路都让我在地图上绘制出了新的区域, 我现在对这些区域已经了然于胸。\n\n我会把我的恐龙全部集合在一起, 明天早上就出发前往那个终端。如果鲍里斯的笔记是正确的, 那这些神器应该可以激活它。我不确信到时候会发生什么, 但是和现在相比还能差到哪里去呢? \n\n只希望其他人可以活着看到这一天。如果我当时有能力拯救他们...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
