    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2808968923",
      "Source": "Turn the hunter into the hunted as you track down an Injured Reaper King and harvest its Reaper Pheromone Gland.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"猎人变成了猎物。追踪一头受伤的死神国王, 并取得它的死神信息素腺体。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1509847522",
      "Source": "Turns out no one else had a better plan, so the wheels are in motion. I've already got teams working on the hangars and gathering resources while I hammer out the schematics.\n\nBuilding these MEKs is going to be one of the hardest things I've ever done, maybe the hardest. With the Gateway Project, I could use the Obelisks as a blueprint, but these are all me. Luckily, having an eidetic memory means I can call on everything I ever studied about robotics, so I'm not starting from scratch.\n\nBesides, this is my true Iove. They say constantly crunching away on a big project will make anyone burn out, but for me it feels like a dip in a lazarus pit. I live for the grind. ",
      "Trans": {"SC":"结果没人有更好的主意, 所以就这么着了。我已经派出小组去建造机库并收集资源, 而我来搞定设计图。\n\n建造这些机甲将会是我做过的最难的一件事了, 或许是最难的。在星门计划中, 我还可以参考方尖碑, 但这次得全靠我自己。幸运的是, 具有超忆症的我可以让我想起此前学习到的关于机器人的全部记忆, 所以还不算从零开始。\n\n另外, 这是我的真爱。他们说一个人如果一直负责大型项目会耗干这个人, 但对于我来说这只是毛毛雨。因为我天生强大, 不畏艰难。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
