    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2793035592",
      "Source": "Useful for spelunking, they can be attached to any surface, self powered by Element Shards , or linked to generators, and picked-up after placement.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"适用于洞穴探险。可以附着在任何物体的表面, 由元素碎片供能或是将其连接到发电机上。放置后可以捡起。","JA":""},
