    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3105234725",
      "Source": "Utilizing Element, enables you to see and shoot through walls and solid surfaces. Also has an optional Thermal Scope.\nEquipping requires learning this Tekgram.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"让你可以看到并射击墙壁或坚固物体后面的东西。另外还配有热成像仪。\n需要先学会该泰克印痕技能才可使用。","JA":""},
