    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3182091751",
      "Source": "Wit and and quick thinking may turn the odds in one's favor, even when nature has other plans.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"智慧和机敏可以在绝境中帮助你扭转劣势。\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::343295499",
      "Source": "Witch Hat",
      "Trans": {"SC":"巫师帽","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1201655814",
      "Source": "With Camp Omega compromised, we've decided to head for the wastes. There's not many of us left, and there's only three mechs remaining - piloted by Mei-Yin, myself and a fiery URE bloke named Kazuma - so we can't form that super weapon Santiago designed. That means if we run into anything too big or too nasty, it'll be trouble.\n\nYet we don't have a choice. The answers are somewhere in that wasteland, and hopefully safety along with them.\n\nGod, this whole piloting thing still feels bizarre, but I guess my nervous system just linked up with the machine really well. And it's what I wanted, isn't it? I'm finally something more than dead weight for other people to lug around, I can do my part. I just hope I don't let everyone down.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"欧米茄营地已经被毁了, 所以我们决定前往荒野。幸存的人不多, 而且只有三台机甲还在——由美盈、我和一个叫和马的URE热血小伙, 所以我们无法组装成圣地亚哥设计出的那台超级武器。\n\n这就意味着, 如果我们碰上太大或者太难缠的东西的话, 我们就有麻烦了。\n\n但是我们别无选择。所有的答案都在这片荒野中的某个角落, 而且我希望有它们在的地方可能是安全的。\n\n老天, 驾驶这个东西依然感觉很奇怪, 但是我猜我的神经系统和机器连接得相当不错。这就是我想要的, 不是吗? 我终于不只是靠其他人拖着走的累赘了, 我能够尽一份力。我只是希望我不会让所有人都失望。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::469456244",
      "Source": "With a mastery of one's equilibrium, no simple poison nor toxin can be a threat.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"心境祥和, 百毒不侵。\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1120147238",
      "Source": "With craft and cunning, to look out for one's self may be essential to survival.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"心灵手巧并且谨慎从事对于生存来说至关重要。\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3196705198",
      "Source": "With craft and strategy, to outwit one's opponents may be essential to survival.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"使用策略, 与对手斗智斗勇对于生存来说至关重要。\n<RichColor Color=\"1, 0, 0, 1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3208665377",
      "Source": "With relentless determination, the hunter will never waiver until it catches its prey.\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">Only one of these may be carried at a time by an organism.</>",
      "Trans": {"SC":"信念坚定的猎手在捕获猎物之前永不言弃。\n<RichColor Color=\"1,0,0,1\">同一时间同一个生物最多可携带一个。</>","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3000954191",
      "Source": "With the MEKs entering their final phase of construction, I decided to give our pilot team a little reward and simulate the MegaMEK fusion procedure. We won't be able to do it for real for another couple weeks, but the sim is pretty accurate.\n\nIt went a lot better than I expected. By our third try, we had it down pat. The only thing that held us up was a lot of joking about who would control which body part. Mei-Yin patently refused to switch off of the sword arm and Helena was convinced that she'd trip us if she took the legs.\n\nI know it goes against my principles as an engineer, but after that, I think I'm actually excited to pilot this thing. Purity be damned.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"现在MEK机甲已经进入了最后的制造阶段, 所以我决定给我们的驾驶员们一点小奖励, 让他们模拟运行力神机甲的合体程序。要再过好几周我们才能够实际运行合体程序, 但是模拟系统已经足够精准了。\n\n事情的发展远远好于我的预期。在我们第三次尝试的时候, 我们就完全熟悉了。唯一困扰我们的问题是, 我们经常开玩笑说应该让谁来控制哪部分。\n\n美盈明确表示她不愿意放弃控制用剑的手臂, 而海伦娜认为如果让她来控制腿部的话, 她会绊倒我们的。\n\n我知道这违背了我当工程师的原则, 但是从那时候开始, 我想我对于驾驶这玩意还是挺兴奋的。纯净感什么的去死吧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3456531488",
      "Source": "With the hearts or minds of his three lieutenants in hand, you must travel across the wastes and walk the forbidden plains - into the heart of the barren garden. It's here where his power is strongest, but he will show himself nowhere else. He has no reason to step down from his throne.\n\nYet in this place, if you call him with the voices of his lessers, then he will come. With all the might and hatred of the violet poison from which he was born, he will answer your call:\n\nThe King of Shadows. The King of Death.\n\nDo not summon him recklessly. Before you challenge him, you'll need to prepare. As it happens, this is one thing I can help you with.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"等你拥有了他三个副官的心脏或是控制了它们的思想后, 你必须穿过荒野, 步入危险的平原——进入荒芜花园的心脏。那里是他力量最强的地方, 但是他不会在别的地方现身。他没有理由从他的王座上走下来。\n\n也正是在这个地方, 如果你用他下级的声音呼唤他, 他就会前来。带着诞生了他的紫色毒液给予他的所有力量和的仇恨, 他会回应你的呼唤。\n\n暗影之王。死亡之王。\n\n不要鲁莽地召唤他。在你挑战他之前, 你需要做准备。正好, 我有一样东西可以帮到你。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4117262098",
      "Source": "Without Ao Yue, we had to move cautiously. Another battle with the demons could prove fatal, but we managed to avoid their sight. All that was left was the climb.\nWith no mount, we had to use climbing picks to slowly make our way upwards. It was a long and treacherous ascent, and we both nearly fell several times. Fortunately, we were there to catch and support each other, and through our combined strength, we safely reached the caverns above.\nAfter the climb, we lay there for a long time. I cannot remember if we laughed or cried. Perhaps both. Juzi says that the item she found could help the entire village, but I do not care. I am just so glad we are both still alive.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"无敖越, 吾须慎行。与怪再战致命也。吾设法避之。所余之法仅攀登也。\n\n无坐骑, 吾不得不以登镐徐上。此旅长而危。吾等诸次几坠, 幸哉吾于桔子相持相扶, 合吾等之力, 终登上穴。\n\n然后吾久卧于此, 不记吾等是啼是笑, 或皆有矣。桔子曰所寻之物可助全村。然吾不以为意, 吾等尚存, 喜也。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::850129826",
      "Source": "Without question, it was Hathor's divine will that sent me here, not only so I could spread her joy and compassion, but so I could understand her love. \n\nI thought I knew it before. I loved my family, I loved my fellow priestesses, and I love all those under my care here in Nosti. Yet only when I finally surrendered myself to it, when I let it rush over my body and carry me like the current of a great river did I truly understand it. Only now can I claim to embody Hathor's teachings, thanks to John Dahkeya, this warrior from a distant time and place.\n\nAnd now, together, we can turn this desert into a paradise.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"毫无疑问, 是哈索尔的神意把我带到了这里。不仅仅是为了让我传播她的快乐与怜悯, 更是为了让我更好地明白她的爱。\n\n我以为在此之前我就知道了何为爱情。我爱着我的家庭、我的同行, 我爱着所有受到我照顾的诺斯提居民。\n\n但是当我最终沉浸于爱情之中, 让它像涌入大海的激流一样冲刷我的身体的时候, 我才正真地明白了何为爱情。唯有现在我才能明白哈索尔的教诲。感谢约翰·达奇亚, 这位来自某个遥远未来的战士。\n\n现在, 我们两个携手可以把这片沙漠变为天堂。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
