    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2634503432",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of a helmet or hat into a decorative halo headband. For those times you want to look good... really good.\n\nNon-human creatures adamantly refuse to wear this.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来将头盔或帽子的外观加上一层装饰性的光环头带。 那些时候你想看起来很好......真的很好。","JA":""},
