    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::873825622",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into a festive tutu for men or women. Love the way you look this season.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变裤子的外观把它变成男士或女士的节日芭蕾舞短裙。喜欢你这一季的样子。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::752147491",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women, and give 'em all pumpkin to talk about!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n然后让他们谈论所有南瓜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1955775580",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women, for a splashy burst of monstrous fun!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n以获得惊人的乐趣!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1984421402",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nA swim suit so cute it's scary -- but stay away from garlic.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n可爱又可怕的泳衣, 注意远离大蒜头。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3774853786",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nA swim suit that clings to you like a spider.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n就像蛛丝那样贴合肌肤。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::797097536",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nA swim suit with lots of \"bat\"-itude..",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n一件充满‘蝙蝠’特色的泳衣。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1962335012",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nBake me up before you dodo.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n爱我你就烤烤我。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4187844407",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nBecome this summer's hottest predator with a Alpha Raptor swim suit.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n穿上精英迅猛龙泳装, 成为今夏最靓的仔。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::97653802",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nCan turkeys swim? Maybe you'll be safe in the water...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n火鸡会游泳吗? 也许你在水里会很安全...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1577570499",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nGive thanks for another great day on the beach.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n感谢上苍, 又可以在沙滩上躺一天了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1772972741",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nGuess that grumpy bruin was hoping for some honey.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n我猜那个脾气暴躁的熊是想要一些蜂蜜。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4245016941",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nMama DodoRex says to wait thirty minutes to go swimming after dinner.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n渡渡鸟妈妈说晚饭后要等三十分钟去游泳。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::122287909",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nRule the beach this summer with the power of flowers.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n盛夏花朵开满全场。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3313511946",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nThey say true love sees but doesn't mind. Good for them!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n它们说真爱是看见后不介意的, 这对它们都有好处!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3434358086",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nWatch out for those teeth!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n小心那些牙齿!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2715418050",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nWhen fashion swimwear \"meats\" holiday attire.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n这就是传说中的“肉”感。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2821686870",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nWhen they form that heart shape, you just feel the love.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n当它们形成心形时, 你就会感受到爱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3744338752",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n\nYou'll be the terror of the beach with swimwear inspired by the T-Rex itself.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n你将如同霸王龙一般, 震撼整个沙滩。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3703578158",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women.\n \nSwim with the ichthyosaurs!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n和鱼龙一起游泳!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2183052279",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \n\nLooks good and eels even better!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n看起来不错, 鳗鱼更好吃!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2097912326",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \n\nMust be jellyfish, because jamfish don't shake like that.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n一定是水母, 因为果酱不会那样晃动。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::739379385",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \n\nNote: will not function as a floatation device.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n注意: 不会真的起到救生圈的作用。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2847631763",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \n\nWarning—might pinch a little.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n警告—可能有点紧。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2065561",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \n\nWith swimwear this fashionable, no one minds you floating in their pool.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成男士的泳裤或是将变成女士的比基尼泳裤。\r\n\r\n没人会介意你和他们泡在一个池子里, 相信我。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1630389575",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. \"Ears\" wishing you happy holidays!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤将裤子变成泳裤。耳朵大, 福气大!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1040418084",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. For swimmers with abominable taste in swimwear.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"您可以使用这个皮肤来将裤子的外观变成男士泳裤或女士比基尼泳裤。对于泳装品味可恶的游泳者。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2893461596",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. Give yourself that festive holiday look.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来将裤子变成泳裤。让你充满节日的气息。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2339182892",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants into swim trunks on men or a bikini bottom on women. Unwrap a mind-bending surprise... A gift to make your head swim!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来将裤子的外观变成男士泳裤或女士比基尼泳裤。解开一个令人费解的惊喜...一份让你头脑清醒的礼物!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::432430789",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants. Provides a natural look!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变裤子的外观。一阵清新的自然风!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::491406251",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of pants. Provides a terrifying look.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变裤子的外观。让人看上去很害怕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2838197289",
      "Source": "You can use this to skin the appearance of your headgear.  Provides a freshly hatched look!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你可以使用这个皮肤来改变头盔或帽子的外观。让你看起来像是刚刚孵出来的!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::4121392105",
      "Source": "You can't get admin access with antivirus protocols active",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在防病毒协议处于激活状态时, 您无法获得管理员访问权限","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1475417792",
      "Source": "You can't move, but Water and Food decrease more slowly, and Torpidity decreases rapidly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你无法移动, 水和食物减少变慢, 眩晕值减少也变慢。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::557795923",
      "Source": "You cannot be frozen!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你不能被冻结!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2949535106",
      "Source": "You cannot be shocked for a time...",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你暂时不会休克...","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2790141852",
      "Source": "You cannot “hack” your way to victory here!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"在这里, 你们无法通过作弊取胜!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3841742862",
      "Source": "You caught a",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你抓到了一条","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2309425913",
      "Source": "You caught one of the top 10 largest fish",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你钓到了最大的十条鱼中的一条!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2039791257",
      "Source": "You collected a {1} key",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你收集到了 {1} 钥匙","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1494295117",
      "Source": "You connive!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你想做坏事!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3972105612",
      "Source": "You could say I went through a lot of trouble for you. I sacrificed, tested and studied, all for you. All so that you could experience death, learn from it, and carry that knowledge with you into another life.\n\nThat is my greatest gift to you - the critical piece in my strategy. It's what allowed you to defy the System and its broken rules. It's what will allow you to bring this planet back from the brink.\n\nBut it's not free. Each time you return from death's clutches, there's a toll. Not for you - for the System. It takes resources, and resources can't be created, only converted. \n\nYou see those islands in the sky are seeds, and when they fall, they'll need what's left of the System's energy to bloom. So when the barren garden is fully revived, you'll lose the ability to revive yourself.\n\nI'm sorry about that, but this is the best plan I had.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可以说, 我为了你经历了许多麻烦。我做出了牺牲, 做过试验, 搞过研究, 都是为了你。我做这么多就是为了让你能够体验死亡, 并从中学习, 然后把那份知识带到下一次生命中。\n\n这是我给你的最大的礼物——是我的计划中最关键的一环。这份礼物让你能够违抗系统, 并打破它的规则。这份礼物也将会帮助你把这颗星球从毁灭的边缘救回来。\n\n但这不是没有代价的。每次你从死亡的手中逃脱后, 都会要付出代价。不是你付出代价——而是系统。复活需要耗费资源, 而资源不能凭空产生, 只能被转化得来。\n\n你看到的天空中的那些岛屿都是种子, 当它们落下后, 它们会需要系统中剩余的能量来成长。所以当这个荒芜的花园完全复苏后, 你将会失去复活的能力。\n\n对此我感到抱歉, 但这是我手头上最好的计划了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1832387367",
      "Source": "You could say I went through a lot of trouble for you. I sacrificed, tested and studied, all for you. All so that you could experience death, learn from it, and carry that knowledge with you into another life.\r\n\r\nThat is my greatest gift to you - the critical piece in my strategy. It's what allowed you to defy the System and its broken rules. It's what will allow you to bring this planet back from the brink.\r\n\r\nBut it's not free. Each time you return from death's clutches, there's a toll. Not for you - for the System. It takes resources, and resources can't be created, only converted. \r\n\r\nYou see those islands in the sky are seeds, and when they fall, they'll need what's left of the System's energy to bloom. So when the barren garden is fully revived, you'll lose the ability to revive yourself.\r\n\r\nI'm sorry about that, but this is the best plan I had.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"可以说, 我为了你经历了许多麻烦。我做出了牺牲, 做过试验, 搞过研究, 都是为了你。我做这么多就是为了让你能够体验死亡, 并从中学习, 然后把那份知识带到下一次生命中。\r\n\r\n这是我给你的最大的礼物——是我的计划中最关键的一环。这份礼物让你能够违抗系统, 并打破它的规则。这份礼物也将会帮助你把这颗星球从毁灭的边缘救回来。\r\n\r\n但这不是没有代价的。每次你从死亡的手中逃脱后, 都会要付出代价。不是你付出代价——而是系统。复活需要耗费资源, 而资源不能凭空产生, 只能被转化得来。\r\n\r\n你看到的天空中的那些岛屿都是种子, 当它们落下后, 它们会需要系统中剩余的能量来成长。所以当这个荒芜的花园完全复苏后, 你将会失去复活的能力。\r\n\r\n对此我感到抱歉, 但这是我手头上最好的计划了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1566833414",
      "Source": "You dance the dance of The Nutcracker.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"你开始跳胡桃夹子舞!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
