    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3541476596",
      "Source": "Thatch structures are easier to build, but can be easily broken into.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"茅草建筑很容易搭建, 但是也很容易被破坏。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2904113411",
      "Source": "The Cooking Pot can make many food and dyes, so experiment!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"烹饪锅可以制作许多食物和染料, 请多多尝试!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::78461219",
      "Source": "The Cooking Pot must contain a Note upon which to write your Recipe!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"烹饪锅中一定要有一个便签才能制作食谱。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2910695435",
      "Source": "The Island Epilogue",
      "Trans": {"SC":"孤岛后记\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2200070408",
      "Source": "The Island Prologue",
      "Trans": {"SC":"孤岛序幕\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3379706081",
      "Source": "The maximum number of items to upload has been reached.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"待上传物品数量已达上限。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::1012764410",
      "Source": "The maximum number of survivors to upload has been reached.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"待上传生存者数量已达上限。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2932901608",
      "Source": "The most dangerous parts of the island yield the greatest rewards. Bring friends, it wont be easy.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"岛上最危险的地方通常也是资源最多的地方, 喊上同伴一起来探险吧!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2890174052",
      "Source": "The ocean is a treacherous place. Be very wary of what dwells out in the deep.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"海洋是一个变化莫测的地方。永远对海中的生物保持十万分的警惕。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::1189302417",
      "Source": "The server you are attempting to join doesn't allow transferring items. Drop your items and try again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"您尝试加入的服务器禁止传输物品。请丢弃所有物品后重试。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2963429799",
      "Source": "The server you are currently on doesn't allow transferring items. Drop your items and try again.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"您目前所处的服务器禁止传输物品。请丢弃所有物品后重试。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3204316476",
      "Source": "The server you are travelling to doesn't allow transferring characters.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"您要前往的服务器禁止传输角色。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::271117055",
      "Source": "The weather on the ARK can be unpredictable, make sure you're well dressed for the elements!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"方舟中的气候常常无法预料, 你得确保自己做好了准备!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3452500321",
      "Source": "There are too many engrams for a normal person to learn. Make sure you have a tribe so you can use everything.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"一个普通人是不可能学完所有印痕技能的。加入部落来取长补短。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3239356402",
      "Source": "There's nothing better than four strong walls and a roof over your head to stave off extreme heat or cold!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"没有什么比你身处室内更能抵御极端温度的办法了!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::2215167109",
      "Source": "Third Person Allowed\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第三人称 已允许\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"2092932048"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::485487942",
      "Source": "Third Person Disabled\n",
      "Trans": {"SC":"第三人称 已禁用\n","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3058688661"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::3426987570",
      "Source": "This is a revamped ARK game mode, with an all-new \nset of Engrams and mechanics focused on primitive-style survival. \nTest your wits and skills to see if you can overcome the challenge of \nconquering the ARK without the benefits of modern technology!",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是定制过的方舟游戏模式, 加入大量\n全新的图纸和机制, 专注于营造原始的\n生活方式。在失去现代科技的情况下, \n挑战你自己, 征服方舟世界吧!","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"3539360590"}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Globals::1579556278",
      "Source": "This is regular ARK : Survival Evolved, \nutilizing the full set of original ARK Engrams.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这是常规的方舟: 生存进化, \n可以使用全部图纸。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":"777747526"}
    },
    {
