    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::1139209044",
      "Source": "The scaling factor for baby Creature food consumption. Higher numbers mean that baby dinos eat their food more slowly.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"幼崽食物消耗的比例系数。数值越高就意味着幼崽的进食更慢。","JA":""},
