    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::4052856246",
      "Source": "The scaling factor for baby Creature maturation. Higher numbers mean faster maturation.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"幼崽成长的比例系数。数值越高就意味着成长的越快。","JA":""},
