    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2830830525",
      "Source": "Purlovia Bury Buff",
      "Trans": {"SC":"","JA":""},
      //普雷兽钻地增益
      //普雷獸鑽地增益
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3666893695",
      "Source": "Purlovia consumes no food while buried.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"钻地的普雷兽不消耗食物","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3159733032",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which the Purlovia has a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Moschops Egg\n1 Cooked Meat Jerky\n1 Savoroot\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受普雷兽的喜爱。\n\n1颗麝足兽蛋\n1份熟肉干\n1个土豆\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1638539249",
      "Source": "For all my caution, I could have never prepared for this.\n\nYesterday, the towers started flashing and glowing like a damn lightning storm. When I saw that, I saddled up one of our cats and went to find Raia as fast as I could. Within minutes, the ground was crumbling beneath us, like the land was trying to swallow the Nosti whole.\n\nOnce I swung Raia up onto the saddle, I had to ride like a man possessed, our cat leaping across broken buildings as they slipped into the ground. Even then we barely made it, but we're the only ones. I spotted Sasha hanging onto a ledge as we escaped, but I couldn't get to him in time.\n\nWe're all that's left.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"尽管我已经处处提防了, 但是我对此根本没有准备。\n\n就在昨天, 那座塔开始闪闪发光, 就像一个该死的雷暴一样。当我看到这个状况的时候, 我就以最快的速度给一头大猫 (刃齿虎) 装上鞍子, 然后飞快地跑去找莱雅。\n\n就在几分钟内, 我们脚下的地面开始塌陷, 就好像这片土地要把诺斯提整个的吞了。\n\n把莱雅拉上鞍子后, 我就像疯了一样地骑着大猫从倒塌的建筑中穿了过去, 眼睁睁地看着那些楼房沉入地下。就算如此我们也才勉强逃了出来, 但只有我们幸存了。\n\n当我们逃出来的时候, 我看到萨沙悬挂在一个岩架上, 但是我没能及时把她救出来。\n\n只剩下我们了。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3731378234",
      "Source": "Saber Slalom",
      "Trans": {"SC":"刃齿虎障碍滑雪","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::1312333232",
