    {
      "NamespaceHash": "GraphLiteral::3116941109",
      "Source": "Species: Rhyniognatha antiquagenitorTime: Early DevonianDiet: OmnivoreTemperament: AggressiveWildI swear, every new creature I come across here makes me more sure they’ve all had their genes tampered with. I know I'm right about this! Take this monster bug I’m calling 'Rhyniognatha antiquagenitor' -- big enough to headline a horror flick, but still light enough to fly and skate across water.Would you believe it also makes a weirdly useful, quick-hardening resin with a variety of uses? It can thicken up its shell for a defensive boost, spray hard bullet-like globs, or squirt soft globs that harden on impact to gum up incoming predators!DomesticatedThis overgrown earwig is just what you need to level up your tribe’s aerial defenses. It can stick itself to creatures or cargo and carry things around your base, and its glue-bombs disrupt Tek just as well as Dinopithecus dung!That said, Rhyniognatha-raising isn't for the squeamish... Their males have a pheromone that invites egg-laying females to use them as hosts. Harvest that pheromone, and you can mark any creature for the female to lay her eggs on. The host then incubates a new generation of larvae that can reap its best traits in the process.If some poor beast gets eggs laid on it by accident, you might still be able to save it by popping it in a cryopod and freezing out the larvae.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"通用名称: 莱尼颚虫\r\n拉丁学名: Rhyniognatha antiquagenitor\r\n正式名称: 祖父莱尼颚虫\r\n时代: 泥盆纪早期\r\n食性: 杂食\r\n性情: 好战\r\n\r\n\r\n野生\r\n说真的, 在这儿我遇到的每一个新物种都让我更加确信他们的基因都被改造过, 我敢发誓, 在这方面我绝对不会出错。就以这种被我命名为\"祖父莱尼颚虫\"的怪物虫为例吧--它的尺寸大到足够成为恐怖片的主角, 但却又相当轻盈敏捷, 可以如溜冰一般划过水面。\r\n而且你敢信它居然还能分泌出一种能够快速硬化且又有多种奇怪用途的黏脂吗? 这种黏脂不仅可以加厚它的外壳以增强防御能力, 还可以用来喷出坚硬的子弹胶状体, 或者直接喷出软胶体, 在击中目标时硬化以黏住来袭的捕食者!\r\n\r\n\r\n家养\r\n如果你想提高部落的空中防御能力的话, 这种巨型的蠼螋正是你所需要的。它可以将生物或货物粘在自己身上并进行搬运, 而且它的黏脂炸弹可以像恐狒粪便一样破坏泰克设备!\r\n说了这么多, 饲养莱尼颚虫的活儿并不适合一般人, 它们的雄性有一种信息素, 可以吸引雌性将它们作为宿主并产卵。\r\n采集这种信息素就可以让你标记任何生物, 并让雌性莱尼颚虫在它身上产卵。然后宿主便会孵化新一代继承了最优遗传特征的莱尼颚虫幼虫。\r\n如果一些可怜的生物意外地被标记了, 你可能还来得及将其收入低温仓来拯救它。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::2555278617",
      "Source": "Rockwell Recipes: Titanoboa Kibble",
      "Trans": {"SC":"罗克韦尔配方: 泰坦蚺饲料","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::3456950499",
      "Source": "This recipe will produce a consumable which the Gigantopithecus, Dunkleosteus, and Thylacoleo have a very high affinity for.\n\n1 Titanoboa Egg\n1 Cooked Meat Jerky\n1 Longrass\n2 Mejoberries\n3 Fiber (aids digestion)\nSubmerge in Water\nCook in a CookingPot",
      "Trans": {"SC":"这种食物深受巨猿、邓氏鱼和霸王龙和袋狮的喜爱。\n\n1颗泰坦蚺蟒蛋\n1份熟肉干\n1个玉米\n2个紫色浆果\n3个纤维 (帮助消化)\n加水没过\n在烹饪锅里烹调","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::988418302",
      "Source": "VR Titanoboa",
